<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Matei ya chitabu chimwe mne pfitabu pfine ipfili mne Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli Inoghile). Pfitabu apfo tsapfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Iwasomi ng'awamanyile bae Imbuli Inoghile ya Matei yandikighwe tsuwachi, lekeni yakoneka tsayandikighwa mne ghumwaka ghwa sitini kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi. Pfipfila ng'ahomanyika ghoya bae hanu hayandikighwe, lekeni iwanu wengi wakwaghitsa yandikighwa Palestina au mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu yandike Imbuli inoghile ino iye Matei, iyakalile msola kodi ahala Yesu ng'ana amsaghule yawe mtumighwa wake. Pfipfila tsaang'ali yomanyika kwa taghwa lya Lawi. Tsakakala yumwe wa iwanang'ina kumi na weli na tsakawandikila pfilongotsi wa Chiyahudi. Alino lyakoneka mwatsi, mana mne chitabu chino mna mbuli ka sitini itsilawa mne ghamaandiko ghe Laghano lya Ghumwande. Tsakabama kulangusa ka Yesu tsakakala Masiha, Mkombotsi iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, iyalongighwe mbuli tsake na manabii. Pfipfila tsakandika mbuli nyingi tsa undewa we Imulungu. Wayahudi tsawalolela Masiya ang'awile mndewa ka iwandewa we iisi. Lekeni Matei kopinga chinu acho kwa kulonga pfinoghile mbuli tse undewa we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli Inoghile yandikighwe na Matei cha chitabu ichinoghile ukwandusila pfitabu pfa Laghano lya Sambi kwaajili ya mbuli tsake nyingi itsilawa mne Laghano lya ghumwande. Cholunga pfinoghile malaghano meli. Iwasomi wakwaghitsa Matei tsakandika ka pfandike Musa mne pfitabu pfake pfitano pfa mwanduso pfa Laghano lya ghumwande. Malangulitso gha Yesu mchidunda, (Matei 5-7) ghodaha ukwighala na Imulungu pfamwing'ile Musa malaghitso. (Kumb 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1-4, Matei kakwandusa Imbuli inoghile kwa kulonga mbuli ya ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu na mwanduso wa sang'ano yake.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mne isula ya 5-25, Matei kolonga mbuli tsa sang'ano ya Yesu na ghamalangulitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 26-28, Matei kolonga mbuli tsa ukufa na ukutsilihuka kwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chitabu cha lukolo lwa Yesu Kiristu, mtsukulu wa Daudi, iyakalile mtsukulu wa Abrahamu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abrahamu tsakamweleka Isaka, Isaka kamweleka Yakobu, Yakobu kamweleka Yuda na ndughu tsake, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda kaweleka Peresi na Sela, mai wawo tsakakala Tamari, Peresi kamweleka Hesironi, Esironi kamweleka Aramu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aramu kamweleka Aminadabu, Aminadabu kamweleka Nasoni, Nasoni kamweleka Salimoni, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Salimoni kamweleka Boasi, mai wake Boasi tsakakala Rahabu, Boasi kamweleka Obedi kwa Rutu, Obedi kamweleka Yese, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yese kamweleka Mndewa Daudi, naye Daudi kamweleka Selemani, mai wake Selemani tsakakala mwehe wa Uriya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Selemani kamweleka Rehoboamu, Rehoboamu kamweleka Abiya, Abiya kamweleka Asa, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asa kamweleka Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati kamweleka Yoramu, Yoramu kamweleka Uzia, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uzia kamweleka Yosamu, Yosamu kamweleka Ahasi, Ahasi kamweleka Hesekiya, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hesekiya kamweleka Manase, Manase kamweleka Amoni, Amoni kamweleka Yosiya, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yosiya kamweleka Yekoniya na ndughu tsake mne ghamatsuwa ghala Wayahudi ghawaghalighwe Babeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wayahudi hawakalile Babeli, Yekoniya kamweleka Setieli, Setieli kamweleka Serubabeli, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Serubabeli kamweleka Abihudi, Abihudi kamweleka Eliyakimu, Eliyakimu kamweleka Asori, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asori kamweleka Sadoki, Sadoki kamweleka Akimu, Akimu kamweleka Eliudi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eliudi kamweleka Eliasali, Eliasali kamweleka Matani, Matani kamweleka Yakobu, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yakobu kamweleka Yosefu, mmale wake Mariya, mai wake Yesu iyokemighwa Kiristu Mkombotsi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo tsakukala na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Abrahamu mbaka Daudi, na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Daudi mbaka Wayahudi hawaghalighwe akula Babeli, na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Wayahudi hawaghalighwe Babeli mbaka kwelekighwa kwa Kiristu Mkombotsi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 2:1-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu tsakukala pfino, Mariya mai wake Yesu tsakalapfighwa tsengele na Yosefu, lekeni ng'ana wawase hamwe bae, Mariya tsakoneka kana inda kwa uwetso wa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yosefu tsakakala imunu yanoghile, ng'abamile bae kumghela ichinyala Mariya, apfo kabama yamleke chinyelenyele. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hang'ali yakwalangula chinu acho, Malaika kamlawila mndoto kamlongela, “Yosefu mwana wa Daudi, uleke kupfuka kumsola Mariya yawe mwehe wako, kwaapfila inda yake ilawa kwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Katsakwelekela imwana mmale, naghwe kutsomwing'a taghwa Yesu. Kwaapfila katsowakombola iwanu wake kulawa mne nzambi tsawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ghose ghano ghalawila kutimilitsa aghala ghayalongile Imtwatsa kubitila nabii,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mwali ng'ana yawase na mmale katsokinda inda,</para>
  <para style="q">katsomweleka imwana,</para>
  <para style="q">nawo watsomkema Imanweli!</para>
  <para style="m">Mana yake, Imulungu kahamwe na twetwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfo Yosefu hayalamke katenda ka malaika pfayamlongele, kamsola Mariya, mwehe wake. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awasile naye bae mbaka hayeleke imwana. Yosefu kamwing'a litaghwa imwana ayo Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwahenza kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu tsakoneka mne ghumji ghwa Betilehemu mne isi ya Yudeya, ghamatsuwa ghala Herodi hakalile Imndewa. Iwanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo iwalawile ubali wa kwalilawila litsua tsawatsa Yerusalemu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>waghutsa, “Yalikwani imndewa wa Wayahudi yelekighwe? Tuyona inondo yake kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua, kuya tutsa kumtamanila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imndewa Herodi na iwanu wose iwali Yerusalemu hawahulike apfo, tsawaghanzika. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Herodi kawakema hamwe iwatambika wakulu na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, kawaghutsa, “Kiristu Mkombotsi yatsakonekela kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Katsakonekela Betilehemu mne isi ya Yudeya, kwaapfila yandikighwa na nabii, <verse number="6" style="v"/>‘Naghwe Betilehemu yuli mne isi ya Yuda, ng'auli mdodo bae mne ipfilongotsi wa Yudeya, kwaapfila kuna ghweghwe katsolawila chilongotsi, naye katsokuwa imdimi we iwanu wangu we Isiraeli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya Herodi kawakema chinyelenyele awala iwanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo ili wamlongele inondo tsailawile tsuwachi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya kawatuma Betilehemu, kawalongela, “Mghende mkabame pfinoghile kwayali imwana. Baho hamtsomwona muye mnilongele ili na nene nighende nikamtamanile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nawo hawamalitse kumhulikitsa imndewa tsawoka, na inondo iyawonile kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsuwa iwalongotsa na ukwima hanu kwayakalile imwana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hawayonile inondo ayo, wadeng'elela sideke. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Apfo wengila mng'anda, wamwona imwana hamwe na Mariya mai wake, nawo wenama hambele hake, wamtamanila. Kuya wapfughula imikoba yawo, wamwing'a nzawadi, nzahabu, upfumba na dawa inoghile iikemighwa manemane.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya woya ukaye yawo kwa inzila ingi, kwaapfila Imulungu tsakawakanya mndoto waleke kumuyila Herodi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutsumila Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu awo hawokile, malaika kamlawila Yosefu mndoto kamlongela, “Winuke, umsole imwana na mai wake, mtsumile Misiri. Mkale ako mbaka hanitsokulongela, kwaapfila Herodi kobama yamkome imwana.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apfo Yosefu kalamka, kamsola imwana na mai wake ichilo chicho, waghenda Misiri. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tsakakala ako mbaka Herodi hayafile. Chinu acho chitendeka ili imbuli yalongile Imtwatsa kubitila nabii itimile, “Tsanimkema mwanangu kulawa Misiri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wadowado wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Herodi hayatangile ka iwanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo wamghutsukila, tsakona maya ng'ani. Kalapfa laghitso iwana wose iwamale iwali Betilehemu na awala iwali habehi wakomighwe, iwana iwakalile na miyaka mili na awala ing'awapfikile miyaka mili kulawa litsuwa lila iwanu wala hawayonile inondo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya achila ichilongighwe na nabii Yeremiya chitimila,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Listi lyohulikighwa ako Rama,</para>
  <para style="q">chililo cha usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q">Raheli kowalilila iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="q">naye kolema kukanzighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila wose wafa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kulawa Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Herodi hayafile, malaika we Imtwatsa kamlawila Yosefu mndoto mne isi ya Misiri, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kamlongela, “Winuke, umsole imwana na mai wake muye Isiraeli, kwaapfila awala iwabamile kumkoma imwana, wose ma wafa.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Apfo Yosefu kenuka, kamsola imwana na mai wake woya Isiraeli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni Yosefu hayahulike Akelao kawa mndewa hanu ha Herodi, aba wake ako Yudeya, tsakapfuka kughenda ako, naye kwaapfila kakanyighwa mndoto, tsakaghenda Galilaya, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kuya kakala mne ghumji ghwa Natsareti. Apfo chitimila achila ichilongighwe na manabii,</para>
  <para style="q">“Katsokemighwa Mnasaleti.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18; Yohane 1:19-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imiyaka mingi hambele Yohane Mbatitsa tsakaghenda mne inyika ya Yudeya, kandusa kuwapetela iwanu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Mtsileke nzambi tsenu kwaapfila Undewa wa kulanga wa habehi!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yohane iyo imunu iyalongighwe ne nabii Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Litsi lye imunu lyokema kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Muiyandae inzila ye Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q">mgholoseleni inzila yake.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohane tsakapfala ghamaghwanda ighatendighwe kwe imighala ye ngamiya, na ghumsipi ghwe ingotsi mchuno, chijo chake tsachikala iwanzighe ne uki ye kwibagho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iwanu wamghendela kulawa Yerusalemu, Yudeya yose na kulawa mne isi tsose itsili habehi ne ghumto Yoridani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Watsitoghola nzambi tsawo na kutsileka, naye kawabatitsa mne ghumto Yoridani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohane hawonile Mafarisayo na Masadukayo wengi womtsila yawabatitse, kawalongela, “Mwemwe iwana we nzoka! Yuhi yawalongele mwodaha kuhepa ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu ikukutsa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mtende aghala igholangusa ka mtsileka nzambi tsenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kwipfikitsa ka mwodaha kuhepa ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu kwa kulonga mwinaye aba wenu Abrahamu. Nomlongelani ghendo, Imulungu kodaha kumtendela Abrahamu iwana kulawa mne ghamabwe ghano. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hoya ma ikighwa mmasina mwe imibiki, apfo chila mbiki ing'aukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile woghanighwa na kwasighwa mmoto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nene nowabatitsa kwa ghamatsi kulangusa ka mtsileka nzambi tsenu. Lekeni ayo iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu kana ingupfu kubita nene, nene sibamighwa bae hata kughala imikwabatsa yake. Ayo katsowabatitsa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na kwa ghumoto. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lungo lwake lwe ukubetela lwa mmoko mwake. Naye katsokunga uhemba na kuwika mkano, na katsolakatsa mikumvi mne ghumoto ing'aghutsimika bae.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatitsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:9-11; Luka 3:21-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalawa Galilaya, kaghenda ghumto Yoridani kubatisighwa na Yohane. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni Yohane tsakabama yamghome, kalonga, “Nene nobamighwa nibatitsighwe naghwe, naghwe konitsila nene?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Uleke sambi iwe pfipfo. Kwaapfila twobamighwa kughatenda aghala ghose ghobama Imulungu.” Kuya Yohane katoghola. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kubatisighwa, bahala kalawa mmatsi. Baho lilanga lipfughuka, kamwona Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kohulumka ka njiwa na kumtsila mchanya mwake. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Ayuno Imwanangu iyoninoghela, noghelighwa naye.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghesighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:12-13; Luka 4:1-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalongotsighwa na Ghumuhe we Imulungu mbaka kunyika yaghetsighwe na Yehile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsakafunga ukuja ghamatsuwa alubaini chilo na misi, kuya tsakona nzala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Baho Setani kamghendela, kamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu, ghalongele ghamabwe ghano ghawe pfighate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikighwa mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. ‘Imunu ng'odaha bae kuwa mghima kwa chijo chiliyeka, ila kwa chila imbuli iyolonga Imulungu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya Setani kamsola Yesu mbaka Yerusalemu, ghumji ghwenzeluke, kamwika mchiswili ghendo mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya kamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu, wilaghatse hasi, kwaapfila yandikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Imulungu katsowalaghitsa wamalaika wake,</para>
  <para style="q">nawo watsokukinda kwa ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q">uleke kwilagha mne ghamabwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Pfipfila yandikighwa, ‘Uleke kumghetsa Imtwatsa Imulungu wako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya Setani kamsola keli mbaka mne chidando chitali ng'ani, kamlangusa undewa wose we isi na ukulu wose we isi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya kamlongela, “Ung'enama hambele hangu na kunitamanila, nitsokwing'a ghano ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda Setani! Kwaapfila yandikighwa, ‘Umtamanile Imtwatsa Imulungu wako, umtumikile yeye yaliyeka!’ ” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya Setani kamleka Yesu, na wamalaika watsa wamtumikila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwanza kuwapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:14-15; Luka 4:14-15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike Yohane wamwika mchifungo, koka Galilaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kalawa Natsareti, kaghenda kukala Kaperinaumu, isi iili habehi ne tsimbu lya Galilaya, na iibakane ne isi ya Sabuloni na ya Nafutali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Achino chitendeka ili achila chayalongile nabii Isaya chitimile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Isi ya Sabuloni na isi ya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q">inzila ya kughendela mna bahali,</para>
  <para style="q">kumwambu mwe Yoridani.</para>
  <para style="q">Galilaya, isi ye iwanu iwali si Wayahudi!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Iwanu iwokala mchisi</para>
  <para style="q">watsakona ghumwanga.</para>
  <para style="q">Awala iwokala mne isi ye chimbeho che lifwa</para>
  <para style="q">ghumwanga ghutsowamwemwesela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kulawa matsuwa agho Yesu kanza kuwapetela usenga wake, “Mleke kutenda nzambi, kwaapfila undewa wa kulanga wa habehi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema iwanang'ina wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:16-20; Luka 5:1-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu lya Galilaya, kawona iwandughu weli, Simoni iyakemighwe Petiri na ndughu yake Andereya. Tsawang'ali wolowa iwasomba kwa nyapfu mne tsimbu lya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mniwinze, nani nitsowatenda muwe iwalowa we iwanu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bahala watsileka nyapfu tsawo, wamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Haghendile hambele chidogho, kawona iwandughu wangi weli, Jakobu imwana we Sebedayo na ndughu yake Yohane. Tsawakala mne mnumbwi hamwe na aba wawo Sebedayo, wotenda nyapfu tsawo. Yesu kawakema, <verse number="22" style="v"/>bahala waghuleka mnumbwi na aba wawo, wamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa, kopeta na kowahonetsa iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:17-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu tsakanga Galilaya yose, kalangulitsa mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela, kawapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile ye Undewa we Imulungu na kawahonetsa iwanu wane matamu ghose. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mbuli tsake tsenela mne isi yose ya Siriya, apfo iwanu wamghalila iwatamu wose, iwoghula utamu wowose, awala iwodununzika, wane pfinyamkela, iwakughwa chisala na awala iwaholole, naye kawahonetsa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na iwanu wengi wamuwinza kulawa Galilaya, isi tsa Dekapoli, Yerusalemu, Yudeya ne isi ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu mchidunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hawonile mtingano ghwe iwanu, kagheluka mchidunda, kuya kakala hasi. Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela, <verse number="2" style="v"/>naye kandusa kuwalangulitsa, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wabweda iwanu wala iwomuhuwila Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila Undewa we kulanga wawo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wabweda awala wane usungu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila watsokanzighwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wabweda awala iwahole,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila watsoihala iisi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wabweda awala wane inzala ne ing'ilu ya kutenda ghayobama Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila Imulungu katsowaghutitsa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wabweda awala wane libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila Imulungu katsowonela libatsi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wabweda awala wane imimoyo inoghile,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila watsomwona Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wabweda awala iwalamulitsi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila watsokemighwa iwana we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wabweda awala iwodununzika kwa kutenda aghala ghayobama Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila undewa wa kulanga wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mbweda iwanu hawatsomlighani na kumdununzani na kumlongani pfihile kwa ughutsu, kwaapfila mwemwe mwoniwinza nene. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mdeng'e na kudeng'elela kwaapfila ghweko lyenu kulu likighwa kulanga, apfi pfipfo manabii wa ghumwande we Imulungu pfawadununzike hala ng'ana mwemwe mwelekighwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Imunyu na ghumwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:50; Luka 14:34-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwemwe mwa imunyu ye isi. Lekeni imunyu ing'ahinyika, angu mtsoghuma choni mbaka ikole keli? Yahela sang'ano bae, apfo yakwasighwa kunze na iwanu woibayugha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mwemwe mwa ghumwanga ghwe iisi. Kaye ing'awa mchidando ng'aidaha bae kwipfisa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwanu ng'awotuwa bae chitasa na kuchighubika ne iseghe, ila wochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa, nacho chowamulikila iwanu wose iwali mng'anda. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe ghumwanga ghwenu ghumulike hambele he iwanu, nawo waghone ghala ighanoghile ighamtenda, wamtunitse Aba wenu iyali kulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Mleke kupfikitsa ka nene nitsa kuleghusa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa au pfitabu pfe manabii we Imulungu. Sitsile bae kuleghusa, ila nitsa kutimilitsa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, mbaka lilanga ne isi hapfitsohupa, kuduhu imbuli ndodo mne Ghamalaghitso iitsoleghusighwa mbaka ghose ghatimile. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyolema kukinda laghitso dodo kulawa mne Ghamalaghitso ghano na kuwalangulitsa iwanu wangi watende pfipfo, ayo katsokuwa mdodo mne undewa wa kulanga. Lekeni ayula iyokinda Ghamalaghitso na kuwalangulitsa iwanu watende pfipfo, ayo katsokemighwa mkulu mne undewa wa kulanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, ka ng'amtenda bae ghobama Imulungu kubita pfawotenda Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, ng'amtsokwingila bae mne undewa wa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Maya</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:57-59)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Muhulika iwanu wa ghumwande pfawalongelighwe, ‘Mleke kukoma, na imunu wowose ang'akoma katsohighighwa.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nowalongelani ghendo, imunu wowose iyomwonela maya ndughu yake, katsohighighwa. Na ayula iyombetsa ndughu yake katsoghalighwa kune libaratsa, na ayula iyomkema ndughu yake, ‘Mbotsi!’ ayo kahabehi ukwingila mne ghumoto ghwa jehanamu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ka komlapfila Imulungu wako nambiko hanu ha kutambikila, na kwokumbuka tsakwisonga na ndughu yako, <verse number="24" style="v"/>tanu uileke nambiko yako hanu aho, ughende wikelamlitse na ndughu yako, kuya uye uilapfe nambiko yako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Wilamle ne imunu iyakughalile kune libaratsa. Utende apfo mng'ali mnzila, hela katsokughala kwe imlamulitsi na imlamulitsi katsokughala kwe asikali mkulu, naye katsokwika mchifungo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nokungela ghendo, ng'utsolawa bae mbaka ulihe sendi yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Muhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Mleke ughoni.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nowalongelani, imunu wowose iyomlolesa ipinga kwa kumbama, ayo ma katenda naye ughoni mmoyo mwake. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ka inenge yako ya kujilo yokuhonza utende ghehile, uing'ole uyase kutali naghwe. Ng'apfu kwaghisa chilungo chako chimwe, kubita kululeka lukuli lwako lwose lwasighwe mne ghumoto ghwa jehanamu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ka wokuhonza utende ghehile, ughane, ughwase kutali naghwe. Ng'apfu kwaghisa chilungo chimwe, kubita kululeka lukuli lwako lwose lwasighwe mne ghumoto ghwa Jehanamu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukwileka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 19:9; Maliki 10:11-12; Luka 16:18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Tsailongighwa, ‘Imunu wowose iyomleka mwehe wake kobamighwa yamwing'e talaka.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nomlongelani, imunu wowose iyomleka mwehe wake, ila kwaapfila katenda ughoni, komtenda yawe mghoni, na imunu wowose iyomkwela ipinga yalekighwe, naye kotenda utsinzi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha ukwilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kuya muhulika iwanu wa ghumwande pfawalongelighwe, ‘Uleke kubena lilaghano, ila ukindilise lilaghano lyako kwe Imtwatsa.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nomlongelani, mleke kwilaha, wala kwa kulanga, kwaapfila acho chighoda che undewa we Imulungu, <verse number="35" style="v"/>au kwilaha kwe isi, kwaapfila aho hanu he ukwikila ghamaghulu ghake, wala kwa Yerusalemu, kwaapfila agho ghumji ghwe Imndewa Mkulu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wala mleke kwilaha kwa litwi, kwaapfila ng'amdaha bae kulutenda lupfili lumwe luwe lutselu au lutitu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mng'alonga ‘Ona,’ iwe ‘Ona,’ na mng'alonga ‘Bae,’ iwe ‘Bae.’ Ichinu chochose kubita agha, cholawa kwa Yehile.</para>
  <para style="s">Inenge kwe inenge</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:29-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Muhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Inenge kwa inenge, na tsino kwa tsino.’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nowalongelani, mleke kwihisanya ne imunu yehile. Imunu ang'akutowa kanza lya kujilo, pfipfila umleke yakutowe kanza lya kumoso. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Na imunu ang'abama kukughala kune libaratsa ili asole lighwanda lyako, mleke asole na likoti lyako pfipfila. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ka imunu kokubama umghalile mtsigho ghwake kwa utali wa chilomita imwe, umghalile kwa chilomita mbili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Umwing'e ayula iyokulomba, na ayula iyobama kukukopa uleke kumwima.</para>
  <para style="s">Mnoghele mwihile wako</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:27-28,32-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Muhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Mnoghele miyagho, na umhile mwihile wako.’ <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lekeni nene nowalongelani, muwanoghele iwehile wenu na muwalombele awala iwomdununzani, <verse number="45" style="v"/>ili muwe iwana wa Aba wenu iyali kulanga. Kwaapfila litsuwa lyake lyowamwemwesela iwanu iwehile na iwanu iwanoghile, naye kowatowela imvula iwanu iwanoghile na iwanu iwehile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ka mwowanoghela iwanu wala iwomnoghelani mwemwe waliheka, mtsopata ghweko lyachi? Apfi iwasola kodi ng'awotenda pfipfo bae? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na ka mwowalamsa ndughu tsenu waliyeka, mtenda choni chikulu kubita iwanu wangi? Angu iwanu ing'awommanya Imulungu ng'awotenda pfipfo bae? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Muwe watimilifu, ka Aba wenu iyali kulanga pfayali mtimilifu.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwapfila iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mwalangitse, mleke kutenda ghanoghile hambele he iwanu ili wamwoneni. Mng'atenda apfo, ng'amtsopata ghweko bae kulawa kwa Aba wenu iyali kulanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Apfo hauweng'a iwahingwa chinu chochose, uleke kwilangusa kwe iwanu. Uleke kutenda ka wang'enye pfawotenda mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela na mne tsinzila, ili iwanu wawatoghole. Nowalongelani ghendo, ma wabokela ghweko lyawo lyose. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni ghweghwe haumwapfila mhingwa, ghumoko ghwako ghwa kumoso ghuleke kumanya achila ichitenda ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ulapfe chinyelenyele. Na Aba wako iyakona ighafisike, katsokughweka.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha kulomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 11:2-4)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Na hamlomba, mleke kwighala ne iwang'enye! Kwaapfila wawo wonoghela kwima mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela na mnzila ili iwanu wawone. Nowalongelani ghendo, ma wabokela ghweko lyawo lyose. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni haulomba, wingile mne chiheleto chako, uhinde libani lyako, umlombe Aba wako yang'akoneka. Kuya Aba wako iyakona aghala ighapfisike, katsokughweka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Hamlomba, mleke kulonga chaka ka iwanu ing'awommanya Imulungu pfowotenda. Kwaapfila wopfikitsa imilungu yawo itsowahulika kwa mbuli tsawo nyingi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo mleke kwighala nawo. Kwaapfila Aba wenu komanya achila chambama ng'ana mumlombe bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mlombe apfi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Aba wetu yuli kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">Taghwa lyako litunyighwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Undewa wako utse</para>
  <para style="q">ghaubama ghatendeke mne isi ka kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Utwing'e leloli ichijo chetu cha chila litsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Utuleghusile ghamatotso ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q">ka twetwe pfatuwaleghusila awala iwatutendile ghamatotso.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Uleke kutwingitsa mne ghamaghetso,</para>
  <para style="q">ila utukombole na ayula Yehile.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghose, ukulu una ghweghwe na ingupfu na utunitso.</para>
  <para style="q">Amina.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mng'awaleghusila iwanu ghamatotso ghawo, na Aba wenu iyali kulanga pfipfila katsowaleghusila ghamatotso ghenu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni ka ng'amuwaleghusila bae iwanu ghamatotso ghawo, naye Aba wenu iyali kulanga ng'atsowaleghusila bae ghamatotso ghenu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha kufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Hamfunga ukuja, mleke kwighala ne iwang'enye iwotenda pfihanga pfawo ka wana usungu ili woneke wafunga ukuja. Nowalongelani ghendo, ma wabokela ghweko lyawo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni haufunga ukuja, ubake ghamafuta mwitwi mwako na uchihopfughe chihanga chako, <verse number="18" style="v"/>ili iwanu waleke kumanya ka kufunga, ila yamanye Aba wako yaliyeka yang'akoneka. Na Aba wako iyakona ighapfisike katsokughweka.</para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri iuli kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:33-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mleke ukwika tsimali tsenu muisi, amwo iwang'onyo ne ing'angagha pfotsihinya, na iwabapfi wobomola ne ukwiba. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni mwike tsimali tsenu kulanga, ako ing'angagha ne iwang'onyo ng'awotsihinya bae, ne iwabapfi ng'awodaha bae kubomola ne ukwiba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hala hane tsimali tsako, ghumoyo ghwako ghutsokala baho.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghumwanga ghwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 11:34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Tsinenge tsitso ichitasa cha lukuli. Ka nenge tsako tsinogha, lukuli lwako lwose lutsakuwa mne ghumwanga. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni ka tsinenge tsako tsiha, lukuli lwako lwose lutsakuwa mchisi. Apfo ka ghumwanga ighuli mghati mwako ghwa ichisi, acho ambe chisi chikulu!</para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu na tsimali</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 16:13; 12:22-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Haduhu imunu iyodaha kuwatumikila iwatwatsa weli, kwaapfila katsomhila yumwe na kumnoghela yungi, au katsomuwinza yumwe na kumbetsa yungi. Ng'amdaha bae kumtumikila Imulungu na tsimali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Apfo nowalongelani, mleke kusumbukila ipfijo au pfokunwa pfambama ili mkale waghima. Wala ng'uli tsenu tsitsopfala choni. Angu ughima ng'aunoghile bae kubita ichijo? Na lukuli ng'alunoghile bae kubita lighwanda? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mlole wapfideghe iwali kulanga, ng'awohanda bae, wala ng'awopfuna bae, wala kwika mkano na Aba wenu iyali kulanga kowaghutitsa! Angu mwemwe ng'amnoghile bae kubita wapfideghe? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuhi mna mwemwe kwa kwisumbula imwenyegho kodaha ukwongetsa utali wake?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ule lelo mwosumbukila ghamaghwanda? Mghalole ghamaluwa ighali kumghunda pfaghokula. Ng'aghosang'ana bae wala ukwitendela ghamaghwanda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na nene nomlongelani, hata Selemani imwenyegho mne tsimali tsake tsose, ng'apfasighwe bae pfinoghile ka luwa limwe mna ghamaluwa ghano. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lelo ka Imulungu koipfatsa apfo imitsani ye kwibagho, leloli yabaha, na ilupfi yakwasighwa mmoto, angu Imulungu ng'atsompfatsani mwemwe bae? Pfii mwemwe yamtoghola chidogho! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo mleke kwisumbula, mwolonga, ‘Tutsakuja choni?’ au ‘Tutsakunwa choni?’ au ‘Tutsopfala choni?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu woghasumbukila agho ghose, na Aba wenu iyali kulanga komanya ka mwoghabama agho ghose. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni tanu muubame undewa we Imulungu, na mtende aghala ghobama Imulungu, naye katsomwing'ani agho ghose. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Apfo mleke kughasumbukila gha ilupfi, kwaapfila gha ilupfi ghatsesumbukila ghenyegho. Chila litsuwa lyesumbukila lyenyegho.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwahigha iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:37-38,41-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mleke kuwahigha iwanu wangi, hela namwe mtsohighighwa ne Imulungu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kwaapfila pfamuwahigha iwanu wangi, namwe pfipfila mtsohighighwa pfipfo, na chamuwahighila iwanu wangi, Imulungu katsotumila chicho kuwahighani mwemwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Ule ulola chibanzi ichili mnenge mwa ndughu yako, na baho ng'ulyona bae libiki ilili mnenge mwako? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfi udahatse kumlongela ndughu yako, ‘Uleke nikulapfe chibanzi ichili mnenge mwako,’ aku mnenge mwako mwenyegho mna libiki? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwa mng'enye ghweghwe! Tanu ulapfe libiki ilili mnenge mwako, kuya kutsodaha kulola pfinoghile na kulapfa chibanzi ichili mnenge mwa ndughu yako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Mleke kuweng'a iwambwa achila ichideghete hela watsomhundukilani na kuwaluma. Mleke kuwasila iwangubi lulu tsenu hela watsosibayugha kwa maghulu ghawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlombe, mbame, mghong'onde</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 11:9-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Mlombe, namwe mtsakwing'ighwa, mbame namwe mtsopata, mgong'onde libani, namwe mtsopfughulilighwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyolomba katsobokela, na imunu wowose iyobama katsopata na ayula iyoghong'onda katsopfughulilighwa libani. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Angu aba wachi kuna mwemwe, imwanaghe ang'amlomba chighate, komwing'a libwe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Au ang'amlomba isomba, komwing'a inzoka? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ka mwemwe yamwihile mwomanya kuweng'a iwanenu aghala ighanoghile, angu Aba wenu iyali kulanga ng'atsakongetsa bae kuweng'a aghala ighanoghile awala iwomlomba! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Muwatendele iwanu wangi aghala ghambama mwemwe wamtendeleni, kwaapfila Ghamalaghitso gha Musa ne pfitabu pfa manabii pfolonga pfipfo.</para>
  <para style="s">Ilibani sisili ne ilibani lighatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 13:24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwingile kwa kubitila libani sisili. Kwaapfila libani lye ukwingilila kutsimu ghatsi na iwanu iwobitila inzila ayo wa wengi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni libani lya ughima dodo na inzila iilongotsa ako ya sisili, ne iwanu iwoyona nzila ayo wadodo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:43-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mwalangitse na manabii we ughutsu. Womtsilani aku wakoneka kwa kunze ka iwang'olo, lekeni mghati mwawo weghala ne wambwa wa kumuhulo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mtsowamanya kwa ghamatunda ghawo. Angu iwanu wobawa fulu mne tsimiwa, au wobawa ng'owo mne mbighili? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pfipfila chila mbiki ighunoghile ghwakweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile, na mbiki ghwihile ghwakweleka ghamatunda ghehile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na mbiki ighunoghile ng'aghukweleka bae ghamatunda ghehile, na mbiki ghwihile ng'aghukweleka bae ghamatunda ghanoghile. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Chila mbiki ing'aghukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile ghwoghanighwa na kwasighwa mmoto. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo mtsowamanya manabii wa ughutsu kwa ghamatunda ghawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwemwe siwamanyile bae</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 13:25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Si chila imunu iyonikema ‘Mtwatsa, Mtwatsa,’ katsokwingila mne undewa wa kulanga, ila awala waliyeka iwotenda aghala ghayobama Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa alyo, iwanu wengi watsonongela ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Kwa taghwa lyako tsatuwapetela iwanu usenga we Imulungu, kwa taghwa lyako tsatuwalapfa iwanu pfinyamkela na kutenda ipfinzonza!’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya nitsowalongela, ‘Mbe, mwemwe simmanyileni bae. Mlawe kuna nene, mwemwe iwanu mwihile!’</para>
  <para style="s">Imtsenga ing'anda yakengele na imtsenga ing'anda mbotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:47-49)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Apfo imunu wowose iyotegheletsa mbuli tsangu na kutsitenda, ayo keghala ne imunu iyakengele, yatsengile ing'anda yake mne bambalawe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imvula itowa, ghamatsi ghamema, libeho liduma, liitowa ing'anda ila. Lekeni ng'aighwile bae kwaapfila lukwambatsa lwake tsalutsengighwa mne bambalawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Lekeni imunu wowose iyotegheletsa mbuli tsangu aku kolema kutsitenda, ayo keghala ne imunu mbotsi, iyatsengile ing'anda yake mne msanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imvula itowa, ghamatsi ghamema, libeho liduma liitowa ing'anda ila, nayo ighwa kwa ngupfu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga agho ghose, mtingano ghwose tsaghukangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake, <verse number="29" style="v"/>kwaapfila tsayang'ali yowalangulitsa ka imunu yane ukulu, na si ka iwalangulitsi wawo wa Ghamalaghitso.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yane ukoma</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:40-45; Luka 5:12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulumke mchidando, mtingano mkulu we iwanu tsaghumuwinza. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe yane ukoma kamghendela, katowa ghamaghoti hambele hake, kamlongela, “Imtwatsa ung'abama, kwodaha kunenda nideghete.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kamkinda imunu ayo. Kalonga, “Nobama, udeghete!” Bahala imunu ayo kahona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Tegheletsa! Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose, ila ughende wikelanguse kwa mlapfa nambiko, kuya ulapfe inambiko iyalaghitse Musa, ka ukalangama kwe iwanu wose ka ghweghwe kuhona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola kwe imkulu we asikali wa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu hayengile Kaperinaumu, imkulu yumwe we asikali wa Roma kamghendela, kamlomba yamwapfile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kamlongela, “Imtwatsa, imtumwa wangu kawasa ukae, kaholola kuya koghula sideke.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Nitsoghenda kumhonetsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imkulu ayo kamwidika, “Imtwatsa nene sinoghile bae ghweghwe kwingila mng'anda mwangu, ila ulonge imbuli iliheka, imtumwa wangu katsohona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hata nene yanilongotsighwa ne iwakulu wangi, nina asikali yaniwalongotsa. Nomlaghitsa yuno, ‘Ghenda!’ naye koghenda, nomlaghitsa ayula, ‘Utse!’ naye kakutsa. Nomlongela imtumwa wangu, ‘Tenda chinu achi!’ naye kotenda pfipfo.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike apfo kakangawala ghendo, kawalongela awala iwamuwinzile, “Nowalongelani, sina mbone bae imunu wowose mne isi ya Isiraeli iyotoghola pfino. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, iwanu wangi watsakutsa kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua na ubali wa kwalikuswela litsua, nawo watsokala mne chihungo hamwe na Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu mne undewa wa kulanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni awala iwabamighwe wawe mne undewa we Imulungu watsakwasighwa kunze, mne ichisi, ako watsolila na kughegheda ghamatsino.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela imkulu yula, “Ghenda ukaye, na achila chautoghole chitsotendeka.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya saa iila imtumwa wake kahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 1:29-34; Luka 4:38-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu hayapfikile ukaye kwa Petiri, kampfika mai wake mkwe Petiri kawasa mlusatsi, koghula lihoma. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kamkinda ghumoko ghwake na lihoma limlawa, naye kenuka kandusa kumtumikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nemihe haipfikile, iwanu wamghalila Yesu wanu wengi wane pfinyamkela, Yesu kawalapfa pfinyamkela kwa kulonga imbuli iliheka, kuya kawahonetsa iwatamu wose, <verse number="17" style="v"/>ili imbuli iyailongile nabii Isaya itimile,</para>
  <para style="q">“Tsakasola maghayo ghetu</para>
  <para style="q">na kabapa matamu ghetu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanang'ina wa Yesu pfawabamighwa kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 9:57-62)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu hawonile mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu ghumtsunguluka, kawalaghitsa wanang'ina wake waloke kumwambu kwe tsimbu lya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya imlangulitsi yumwe wa Ghamalaghitso kamghendela, kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, nitsokuwinza kokose kwaughenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Iwambwa wa kumuhulo wana tsimango, na pfideghe iwali mlanga wana pfibali, lekeni imwana we imunu kahela hanu ha ukuwasitsa litwi lyake.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Imwanang'ina wake yumwe kamlongela, “Mndewa, undeke tanu mbuke ukaye ng'amtsike aba wangu.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kamlongela, “Uniwinze, waleke iwanu iwafile wawatsike iwanu wawo iwafile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 4:35-41; Luka 8:22-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi, na iwanang'ina wake wamuwinza. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bahala ilawila inyahemu ng'ulu mne tsimbu na ghamatsi ghang'ali ghakwingila mne mnumbwi, lekeni Yesu tsakawasa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlamsa, walonga, “Imtwatsa, utukombole twotsama!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Mwemwe yamtoghola chidogho, ule mpfuka?” Kuya kenuka, kaikembela inyahemu na ghamawimbi, baho tsimbu linyamala tulu ghendo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iwanu wose tsawakangawala, weghutsa, “Angu ayu munu wachi? Hata libeho na ghamawimbi pfose pfomuhulikitsa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu weli wane pfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 5:1-20; Luka 8:26-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hayapfikile kumwambu, mne isi ya Gerasi ketingana ne iwanu weli wane pfinyamkela wolawa mne tsikabuli. Iwanu awo tsawakala wakali sideke, kuduhu imunu iyadahile kubita inzila ayo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bahala wakemelela, “Angu utubamila choni, ghwee Imwana we Imulungu. Pfii kutsa kutudununza ng'ana ichipindi chetu chipfike?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Habehi ne hanu aho, tsakukala ne iwangubi wengi wakuja. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pfinyamkela awo wamlomba Yesu, “Ung'atulapfa, utuleke twingile mne iwangubi wala.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Haya laweni!” Baho wawalawa iwanu awo, wawengila iwangubi, na iwangubi wose watsumila mne muhulumko mkulu, wengila mne tsimbu na wose wafila mmatsi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwadimi we iwangubi awo tsawatsuma mne ghumji. Hako wawalongela aghala ghose na achila ichiwalawilile iwanu wane pfinyamkela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wose waghenda kwitingana na Yesu. Na hawamwonile, wamlomba yoke mne isi yawo.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yahole.</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 2:1-12; Luka 5:17-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi, kaloka kumwambu koya mne ghumji ghwake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wamghalila imunu iyaholole iyawasile mne chilagho. Yesu honile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu yula iyaholole, “Ughumighwe ghumoyo mwanangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bahala iwalangulitsi wangi wa Ghamalaghitso tsawelongela. “Imunu yuno komligha Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya achila chawang'ali wakwalangula. Apfo kawaghutsa, “Ebali mkwalangula ghehile mne imimoyo yenu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chihi chibewe, kulonga, ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa,’ au kulonga, ‘Winuke ughende’? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lelo nobama mmanye ka Imwana we Imunu kana uwetso muisi wa kuwaleghusila wanu nzambi.” Kuya kamlongela imunu iyaholole, “Winuke, usole chilagho chako, uke ukaye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Baho imunu yula kenuka, koka ukaye. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu hawonile pfino tsawapfuka, wamtunya Imulungu, iyaweng'ile iwanu uwetso awo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Matei.</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 2:13-17; Luka 5:27-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu tsakoka hanu aho, na hayang'ali yoghenda, kamwona imsola kodi, iyakemighwe Matei. Kakala hanu ha ukulihila kodi, Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze,”</para>
  <para style="p">Matei kenuka kamuwinza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yakuja ichijo cha nemihe mng'anda, iwasola kodi wengi na iwanu wehile watsa na ukuja naye hamwe na iwanang'ina wake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafarisayo hawonile apfo, wawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Ule mlangulitsi wenu kakuja ne iwanu wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike apfo, kawalongela, “Si iwanu waghima bae iwobama mghanga, ila iwatamu iwo iwobama mghanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni mghende mkelangulitse mana ye imbuli ino, ‘Nobama libatsi, wala si inambiko bae.’ Kwaapfila sitsile bae kuwakema iwanu wanoghile, ila iwanu wehile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanang'ina womghutsa Yesu imbuli ya ukufunga ukuja.</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 2:18-22; Luka 5:33-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwanu iwamuwinzile Yohane Mbatitsa tsawamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Ule twetwe na Mafarisayo twofunga, lekeni iwanang'ina wako ng'awofunga bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi yodahika iwahenza iwakemighwe mne chihungo che ukukwela walile aku imunu iyokwela yang'ali nawo? Mbe! Ng'aidahika bae, litsuwa litsakutsa imunu iyokwela katsosolighwa kulawa mna wawo, baho watsofunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Iwanu ng'awochika bae ichalaka che lighwanda lya sambi mne lighwanda lya ghumwande, kwaapfila ichilaka acho chitsolidegha lighwanda lya ghumwande, na hala ihadegheke hatsakongetseka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pfipfila kuduhu imunu yoghuma dipfai ya sambi mne pfibuyu pfe ghumwande, ang'atenda apfo, pfibuyu apfo pfitsotulika na dipfai itsakwitika. Ila dipfai ya sambi yoghumighwa mne pfibuyu pfa sambi, kuya pfose pfibili pfokala ghoya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chigholi iyafile na ipinga mtamu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 5:21-43; Luka 8:40-56)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hayang'ali yolonga apfi, imkulu wa Wayahudi kamghendela, kamtowela ghamaghoti, kalonga, “Mwanangu kafa sambisambi, lekeni utse umwikile ghumoko katsohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kenuka, koka naye, na iwanang'ina wake woka hamwe naye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ipinga yumwe iyang'ali yoghula utamu wa ukulawa idamu kwe imiyaka kumi na mili kamtsila Yesu kuchughu, kakinda imindo ye ghwanda lyake. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tsakelongela mwenyegho, “Ning'akinda lighwanda lyake, nitsohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kahunduka kamwona ipinga ayo, kamlongela, “Mwanangu, ughumighwe ghumoyo! Ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa.” Bahala ipinga hayo kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu tsakapfika mng'anda mwa imkulu ayo. Na hayawonile awala iwotowa pfimbeta na mtingano we iwanu iwolila, <verse number="24" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Mlawe kunze, imwana ng'afile bae, ila kawasa!” Lekeni wawo tsawamseka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mtingano ghwe iwanu haghulawile kunze, Yesu kengila mghati, kamkinda ghumoko, bahala kenuka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mbuli ino yenela mne isi tsose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa pfifita weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu tsakoka hanu hala, hayang'ali mzila pfifita weli wamuwinza, aku wokemelela, “Utwonele libatsi, Imwana wa Daudi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hayengile mng'anda, pfifita wala weli wamghendela, Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwotoghola ka nene nodaha kuwahonetsa?” Wedika,</para>
  <para style="p">“Ona, Imtwatsa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya katsikinda nenge tsawo, kalonga, “Iwe ka pfamtoghola!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nenge tsawo tsidaha kwona, Yesu kawakanya ghendo, “Mwalangitse, imunu wowose yaleke kumanya agha ghose.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni woka, watsipwililisa mbuli tsake mne isi ila yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa chibubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wakuka, iwanu wamghalila Yesu imunu chibubu yane ichinyamkela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bahala ichinyamkela hayalapfighwe, Imunu yula chibubu kandusa kulonga. Iwanu wose tsawakangawala walonga, “Ng'ana chilawile bae chinu ka chino mne isi ya Isiraeli!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lekeni Mafarisayo walonga, “Imkulu we pfinyamkela iye iyomwing'a Yesu uwetso wa kulapfa pfinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowonela libatsi iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu tsakaghenda mne tsiisi na kaye tsose, kalangulitsa mne tsing'anda tsawo tse ukulombela, kawapetela Imbuli Inoghile ya Undewa we Imulungu na kuwahonetsa iwanu chila utamu na maghayo ghose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu haghwonile mtingano ghwe iwanu, kawonela libatsi kwaapfila tsawakala wepfa na wapwililika ka iwang'olo iwalihela imdimi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Ghamapfuno mengi, lekeni iwatenda sang'ano wadodo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Apfo mumlombe Imtwatsa we ghamapfuno, yawaghale iwatenda sang'ano mne mghunda ghwake.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 3:13-19; Luka 6:12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu tsakawakema hamwe iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kaweng'a uwetso wa ukulapfa pfinyamkela na kuhonetsa utamu na maghayo ghose. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aghano igho ghamataghwa ghe iwatumighwa kumi na weli, wa mwanduso; Simoni iyakemighwe Petiri na ndughu yake Andereya, Jakobu na ndughu yake Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Filipi na Batalomeyo, Tomasi na Matei iyakalile imsola kodi; na Jakobu imwana wa Alifayo, na Tadei, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Simoni Mkananayo na Yuda Isikarioti iyamsaliti Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwatumighwa kumi na weli.</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:7-13; Luka 9:1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu tsakawatuma Iwatumighwa awo, kawalaghitsa, “Mleke kughenda kwe iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu bae, au mne isi tse Wasamariya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ila mghende kwe iwanu we isi ya Isiraeli yawaghile ka iwang'olo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hamghenda, muwapetele mbuli ino, ‘Undewa we Imulungu wa habehi.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Muwahonetse iwatamu, muwatsilihule iwafile, muwahonetse wakoma, mlapfe pfinyamkela. Mwemwe mbokela hela, apfo lapfeni hela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kusola nzahabu, pfetsa, shaba mne pfibindo pfenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mleke kusola mkoba we ghumwanza, wala ghamaghwanda meli, wala imikwabatsa, wala ing'weku. Kwaapfila mtenda isang'ano kobamighwa yeng'ighwe maliho ghake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hamkwingila mne isi au kaye yoyose, mbame imunu yanoghile, mkale mng'anda amwo mbaka hamkuka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hamkwingila mng'anda, mlonge, ‘Mkale tseghamba.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wenye kaye wang'ambokelani, nawo watsokala tseghamba, lekeni ka ng'awombokelani bae, mwemwe mtsokala tseghamba. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'alema kuwabokela, au kutegheletsa mbuli tsenu, hamkuka mkung'use litimbwisi ilili mmaghulu mwenu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, itsakuwa ng'apfu kwa Sodoma na Gomola, kubita kwe isi ayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukudununzika kwa iwanang'ina</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:9-13; Luka 21:12-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Nowatuma ka iwang'olo iwali mghati mwe wambwa wa kumuhulo. Apfo mwobamighwa mkengele ka nzoka na muhole ka njiwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwalangitse ne iwanu, kwaapfila wasowaghala mne mabalatsa, kuya watsowafapula mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mtsoghalighwa hambele he iwakulu ne iwandewa kwaajili ya nene, mpete Imbuli Inoghile kuna wawo na kwe iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hamtsoghalighwa mne libalatsa, mleke kwalangula mtsolonga choni, kwaapfila mtsakwing'ighwa gha ukulonga mne chipindi chicho, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kwaapfila si mwemwe bae yamlonga, ila Ghumuhe wa Aba wenu katsolonga kubitila mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ndughu katsomsaliti ndughu yake yakomighwe, na aba katsomsaliti imwanaghe, nawo iwana watsowasaliti aba tsawo na kuwakoma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwanu wose watsowahila kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu, lekeni ayula iyodudumila mbaka utsighilo katsokombolighwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hamdununzighwa mne isi imwe, mtsumile isi ingi, nowalongelani ghendo ng'amtsomalitsa bae isang'ano yenu mne isi tsose tsa Isiraeli ng'ana Imwana we Imunu yatse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mwanang'ina ng'ombita bae imlangulitsi wake, wala imtumwa ng'ombita bae imtwatsa wake. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yotosha imwanang'ina kwighala ne imlangulitsi wake, na mtumwa kwighala ne imtwatsa wake. Ka imbala we ing'anda kokemighwa Belisebuli, angu iwanu iwali mng'anda mwake ng'awatsokemighwa mataghwa ghehile ng'ani?</para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi wa kumpfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:2-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Apfo mleke kupfuka iwanu. Chochose ichighubikighwe, chitsoghubulighwa na chochose ichipfisighwe chitsakoneka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Achila choniwalongelani mchisi, mwemwe mchilonge mne ghumwanga. Achila chamuhulika chinyelenyele, mwemwe mchikemelele kwa kwima mchiswili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mleke kuwapfuka awala iwokoma lukuli ila ng'awodaha bae kuukoma muhe, ila mumpfuke ayula iyodaha kuhinya lukuli na muhe mne ghumoto wa jehanamu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Apfi iwasolwe weli ng'awoghulighwa kwa sendi imwe bae? Lekeni kuduhu yumwe iyolaghala hasi ka Aba wenu ng'abamile bae. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hata tsimvili itsili mwitwi mwenu tsipetighwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo mleke kupfuka, mwemwe mnogha kubita iwasolwe awo!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola na kumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:8-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene hambele he iwanu, nene pfipfila nitsomtoghola hambele ha Aba wangu yali kulanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu wowose iyonibela nene hambele he iwanu, na nene nitsombela hambele ha Aba wangu yali kulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Sitsile bae kuwatenda iwanu wakale tseghamba, ila nighala lipanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:51-53; 14:26-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mleke kupfikitsa ka nene nitsa kuwatenda iwanu wakale tseghamba muisi. Mbe! Sitsile bae kuwatenda iwanu wakale tseghamba, ila nighala lipanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nitsa kuwatenda mwisonge, imunu na aba wake, imwana na mai wake, mwalipfala na mwalipfala wake. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na iwehile we imunu watsokuwa iwanu wa mkaye mwake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Imunu wowose iyomnoghela aba na mai wake kubita nene, ayo ng'oninoghela bae. Na imunu iyowanoghela iwanaghe kubita nene, ayo ng'oninoghela bae. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Na imunu wowose yang'osola ghumsalaba ghwake na kuniwinza, ayo ng'oninoghela bae. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama ughima wake katsowaghisa, na wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake kwaajili ya nene, katsowona.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghweko</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Ayula iyowabokelani mwemwe, konibokela nene, na ayula yonibokela nene, kombokela ayula iyanitumile. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyombokela nabii kwaapfila yeye nabii, ayo katsobokela ghweko lya nabii, na imunu wowose iyombokela imunu iyanoghile kwaapfila yeye kanogha, katsobokela ghweko lya imunu iyanoghile. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, imunu wowose iyomwing'a chikombe che ghamatsi ighopfegha imunu yumwe we iwadodo wano kwaapfila yeye ka yumwe we iwanang'ina wangu, katsopata ghweko lyake.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 7:18-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kuwalangulitsa iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, koka hanu aho kaghenda kulangulitsa na kuwapetela iwanu mne imiji ya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yohane iyakalile mchifungo hayahulike aghala ghayatendile Kiristu, kawatuma iwanang'ina wake wamghutse, <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Apfi ghweghwe kwa ayula iyalongile Yohane kwakutsa, au tumlolele yungi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Muye na mumlongele Yohane agha ghamuhulika na ghamghona, <verse number="5" style="v"/>ipfifita wakona, ipfimbete woghenda, na wane ukoma wodeghetetsighwa, ipfitsiwi wohulika, iwafile wotsilihuka, na iwahighwa wopetelighwa Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kabweda imunu yula yang'ombonela nene mashaka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwanu iwamuwinzile Yohane hawang'ali wakuka, Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanu mbuli tsa Yohane, “Hamghendile kunyika, mghendile kulola choni? Lutsani pfaluhighisighwa na libeho? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ka si pfipfo bae, mghendile kulola choni? Imunu iyapfalile ghamaghwanda ghanoghile? Bae, awala iwopfala ghamaghwanda ghanoghile wokala mne tsing'anda tse iwandewa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya tsamghendile kulola choni? Inabii? Ona, nowalongelani, mmwona mkulu kubita nabii. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ayuno iyo yuyo iwamwandike mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. ‘Nitsomtuma msenga wangu akulongolele, katsokwandalila inzila yako.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, mne iwanu wose iwelekighwe ne iwapinga, kuduhu wowose iyali mkulu kubita Yohane Mbatitsa, pfipfila ayula iyali mdodo ghendo mne undewa wa kulanga, ka mkulu kubita yeye. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kulawa ghamatsuwa gha Yohane Mbatitsa mbaka sambi undewa wa kulanga wosolighwa kwa ingupfu, na iwanu wane ingupfu wouboka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na manabii wose tsawalonga mbuli ya undewa mbaka ghamatsuwa gha Yohane. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na ka mwobama kutoghola, Yohane iyo Eliya iyatsile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yane ghamaghutwi na yahulike!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Apfi iwanu wa ghamatsuwa ghano weghala na choni? Weghala ne iwana wadodo iwakalile kusoko, wowakema wayawo wolonga, <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Tuwatowela pfimbeta, lekeni ng'ambighile bae! Tuwembila wila wa usungu, lekeni ng'amlilile bae!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yohane tsakatsa, ng'ajile bae wala ng'anwele, nawo tsawalonga, ‘Kana chinyamkela!’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imwana we imunu tsakatsa, kakuja na kakunwa, nawo walonga, ‘Mumlole imunu yuno, yane batsu na mpatika, sale tsake iwasola kodi na iwotenda ghehile.’ Lekeni ihekima ye Imulungu yoneka inogha kwa sang'ano tsake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Isi itsilema kutoghola tsitsoghaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kandusa kutsikembela isi tsila tsayatendile pfinzonza pfingi, kwaapfila ng'atsilekile nzambi bae. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ghweghwe Kolasini kutsoghaya! Ghweghwe Betisaida kutsoghaya! Ka pfinzonza ipfitendeke kuna mwemwe, tsapfitendeka Tiro na Sidoni, iwanu wang'alekile nzambi tsawo kwa kupfala ghamaghunila na kwibaka lipfu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni ghendo itsakuwa ng'apfu mne litsuwa lye ukuhigha kwe iwanu wa Tiro na Sidoni kubita kuna mwemwe! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Naghwe Kaperinaumu! Apfi kwobama winulighwe mbaka mlanga? Kutsohulumsighwa mbaka kutsimu. Ka pfinzonza ipfitendeke kuna mwemwe, pfitendeka Sodoma, isi ayo ing'akalile mbaka leloli! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni nowalongelani, mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, Imulungu katsoyonela libatsi isi ya Sodoma kubita mwemwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mtse kuna nene mbwihile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Chipindi chicho Yesu tsakalonga, “Nokutunya ghwee Aba, Imtwatsa wa kulanga na isi kwaapfila kuwapfisa pfinu pfino iwanu wane ihekima na iwakengele, kuwaghubulila iwana wadodo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ona, Aba wangu, apfi pfipfo pfaunoghelighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Aba wangu kangaya pfinu pfose. Kuduhu iyommanya Imwana, ila Aba, na kuduhu iyommanya Aba, ila Imwana, na wowose yula Imwana iyobama kumghubulila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mtse kuna nene, mwemwe wose imdununzighwa ne imitsigho mitito, na nene nitsowatenda mbwihile. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Msole nira yangu, mwilangulitse kulawa kuna nene, kwaapfila nene nihola kuya na mwenyepfale we ghumoyo, namwe imimoyo yenu itsobwihila. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nira yangu ndeke, na mtsigho ghwangu mbewe.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:30">Wang'ombe weli wane nira yo ukulimila msingo</figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imtwatsa wa Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 2:23-28; Luka 6:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa agho, Yesu tsayang'ali yobita mne imighunda ya uhemba mne litsuwa lya Sabato, iwanang'ina wake nzala tsaiwaluma, apfo wandusa kuhulula imikungwi ya uhemba, kuya waija. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafarisayo hawonile apfo, wamlongela Yesu, “Lola, iwanang'ina wako wotenda chinu ichighomighwe mne litsuwa lya Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'amsomile bae achila chayatendile Daudi, yeye na weyaghe hawakalile ne inzala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tsakengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu. Yeye na weyaghe, kuya waja pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu, hata ka tsamwiko yeye na weyaghe kupfija, ila iwabamighwe kupfija iwo iwatambika wakulu waliyeka. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angu ng'amsomile bae mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, watambika wakulu wolibetsa litsuwa lya Sabato mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, lekeni ng'awakwoneka ka watotsa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lelo, nomlongelani, hano hana iyali imkulu kubita lng'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ghamaandiko gholonga, ‘Nobama libatsi, na si nambiko bae.’ Mng'amanyile mbuli tsino tsolonga choni, mng'alekile kuwahigha iwanu iwalihela matotso. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu iyo Imtwatsa we litsuwa lya Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imunu yane ghumoko ighuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 3:1-6; Luka 6:6-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu koka hanu aho, kengila mne ing'anda yawo ya ukulombela, <verse number="10" style="v"/>baho tsakukala na imunu yumwe yane ghumoko ighuholole. Iwanu wangi wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi ng'aighomighwa kumhonetsa imunu mne litsuwa lya Sabato?” Wamghutsa apfo ili wapate imbuli ya ukumghoghela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Apfi imunu yuhi kuna mwemwe ing'olo wake ang'engila mwikolongo mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, ng'atsomkwegha yamlapfe kunze?” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imunu kanogha kubita ing'olo! Apfo ng'atughomighwa bae kutenda ghanoghile mne litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya kamlongela imunu yula, “Gholosa ghumoko ghwako.” Kaghugholosa, nagho ghuhona ka ghumoko ghwake ghungi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apfo Mafarisayo wala tsawalawa kunze, kuya wabama inzila pfawatsomkoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imtumighwa iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu hayaimanyile imbuli ayo, koka hanu hala, na iwanu wengi wamuwinza. Naye kawahonetsa iwatamu wawo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kuya kawaghoma waleke kuwalongela iwanu wangi mbuli tsake. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tsakatenda apfo ili achila chayalongile nabii Isaya chitimile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ayuno mtumighwa wangu iyanimsaghule,</para>
  <para style="q">iyoninoghela, na iyonideng'elesa.</para>
  <para style="q">Nitsoghuma Ghumuhe ghwangu mchanya mwake,</para>
  <para style="q">katsotsipetela isi tsose ukuhigha kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ng'atsesonga wala ukukemela,</para>
  <para style="q">kuduhu imunu iyatsohulika litsi lyake mnzila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ghumlanzi ighuhondeke ng'atsoghubena bae,</para>
  <para style="q">wala ichitasa ichilapfa lihosi ng'atsochitsima bae,</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka aitende haki itawale.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwanu we isi tsose watsolilolela taghwa lyake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 3:20-30; Luka 11:14-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya wamghalila Yesu imunu yumwe chifita iyakalile chibubu kwaapfila tsakakala na chinyamkela, Yesu tsakamhonetsa mbaka kadaha ukulonga ne ukwona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iwanu wose tsawakangawala, walonga, “Ayuno kodaha kuwa imwana we Daudi?” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni Mafarisayo hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Imunu yuno kolapfa pfinyamkela kwa ukwapfilighwa na Belisebuli, mkulu we pfinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya chawang'ali wokwalangula, kawalongela, “Undewa wowose iwighola wenyegho kwa wenyegho utsohinyika. Isi au kaye yoyose iighola yenyegho kwa yenyegho ng'aitsokwima bae. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Setani ang'amlapfa Setani, ayo keghola imwenyegho. Lelo undewa wake utsakwimatse? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwolonga nolapfa pfinyamkela kwaapfila Belisebuli konyapfila kutenda apfo. Lelo yuhi iyoweng'a iwanu wenu ingupfu ye kulapfa pfinyamkela? Iwanu wenu iwenyegho watsowahighani mwemwe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni ka nolapfa pfinyamkela kwa Ghumuhe we Imulungu, mmanye ka undewa we Imulungu ma uwatsila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Kuduhu imunu yodaha kwingila mne ing'anda ye imunu yane ngupfu na kusola pfinu pfake, mbaka tanu yamwohe imunu ayo? Baho lelo katsodaha kumboka ipfinu pfake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Imunu ka ng'ali hamwe na nene bae, ayo konibela, na imunu ing'ayokunga na nene, ayo kopwililisa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo nowalongelani, chila matotso na maligho ghawotenda iwanu, watsoleghusighwa nzambi atso, lekeni ayula iyomligha Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ng'atsoleghusighwa nzambi ayo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyomlonga pfihile Imwana we Imunu katsoleghusighwa nzambi, ila ayula iyomlonga pfihile Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ng'atsoleghusighwa nzambi mne ghamatsuwa ghano au ighakutsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghumbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 6:43-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Mghutende ghumbiki ghunoghe na ghamatunda ghake ghanoghe au mghutende ghumbiki ghwihe na ghamatunda ghake ghehe. Kwaapfila ghumbiki ghomanyika kwa ghamatunda ghake. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwemwe iwana we nzoka, apfi mdahatse kulonga ghanoghile na mwemwe iwenyegho mwiha? Kwaapfila imunu kolonga achila ichimemile mne ghumoyo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imunu yanoghile kolapfa ipfinu ipfinoghile kulawa mne atsina ye ipfinu ipfinoghile, na imunu yehile kolapfa ipfinu pfihile kulawa mne atsina ye ipfinu pfihile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Apfo nowalongelani ghendo, mne litsuwa lya kuhigha iwanu watsobamighwa wedike kwaajili ya chila imbuli ihile yawolonga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mana kwa ghaulonga kutsohighighwa ka kwahela ghamatotso au kuna ghamatotso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chitango cha Yona</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:11-12; Luka 11:29-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuya iwalangulitsi wangi wa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo wangi wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, twobama twone chitango kulawa kuna ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Mweleko ghwihile na wa ughoni wobama chitango! Lekeni ng'amtsakwing'ighwa chitango ila chitango cha nabii Yona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ka Yona pfayakalile munda mwe isomba mkulu ghamatsuwa madatu chilo ne imisi. Pfipfo Imwana we Imunu pfayatsokala ghamatsuwa madatu chilo ne imisi mne ghumoyo ghwe isi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwanu wa Ninawi watsakwima na mweleko ghuno mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, kuya watsowahighani, kwaapfila tsawaghaleka ghamatotso ghawo hawapetelighwe na Yona. Na hano hana mkulu kubita Yona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lye ukuhigha Malikiya wa Sheba katsakwima ne iwanu wa mweleko ghuno, naye katsowahighani kwaapfila tsakatsa kulawa mne isi yake, kutegheletsa ghamalangulitso gha ihekima ya Selemani, na sambi hano hana mkulu kubita Selemani.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kwe ichinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 11:24-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Chinyamkela hayomlawa imunu, kakwangakwanga mne isi isakale kobama hanu ha ukubwihila, na ka ng'opata bae hanu, <verse number="44" style="v"/>kelongela imwenyegho, ‘Mbuye ukaye yangu,’ na hayatsakuya na kuyona ing'anda yahela ichinu, iseghighwa na ikighwa ghoya, <verse number="45" style="v"/>kakuka na kusola pfinyamkela wangi saba wehile kubita yeye, nawo wakwingila na kukala amo. Na ughima wa imunu ayo utsokuwa wiha kubita wa mwanduso. Apfo pfipfo pfaitsakuwa kwa mweleko ghuno ghwihile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mai wake Yesu na ndughu tsake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 3:31-35; Luka 8:19-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolonga ne mtingano, mai wake na ndughu tsake hawapfikile wema kunze, tsawabama walonge naye. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Apfo imunu yumwe kamlongela, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wakunze, wobama walonge naghwe.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Yuhi mai wangu? Wahi ndughu tsangu?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kuya kawagholosela ghumoko iwanang'ina wake kalonga, “Hawano iwo mai wangu na ndughu tsangu! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyosang'ana achila choyobama Aba wangu wa kulanga, hayo ka mai wangu, na ndughu yangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa lilila Yesu kalawa mne ing'anda ila kaghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ako kakala hasi, kalangulitsa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mtingano mkulu tsaghumtsunguluka mbaka kengila mne mnumbwi na kukala amo, na iwanu wose wema mmbambali mwe tsimbu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawalongela mbuli nyingi kwa imifano, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p">“Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe iyaghendile kuhanda tsimbeghu tsake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hayang'ali yopwililisa tsimbeghu, tsingi tsilaghalila habehi ne inzila, iwapfideghe watsa watsija. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsingi tsilaghalila mne ghamabwe hanu hane lidongo chidogho. Tsota himahima na kukula kwaapfila lidongo ng'alighendese hasi bae. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni litsua halilawile, imimeya inyala, na kwaapfila imitsisi ng'aighendese hasi bae imimeya isakala. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mne tsimiwa, tsimiwa tsikula, tsipfingilila imimeya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo linoghile, tseleka, imwe mia imwe, imwe sitini, na ingi selathini. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yane ghamaghutwi na yahulike!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga ebali kowalongela kwe imifano</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 4:10-12; Luka 8:9-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamghutsa, “Ule ulonga ne iwanu kwa imifano?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Mwemwe mtendighwa mdahe kutsimanya mbuli tsa undewa we Imulungu, lekeni wawo ng'awatendighwe apfo bae. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila imunu wowose yane ichinu, katsakongetsighwa ghendo, na ayula iyalihela ichinu, katsobokighwa hata achila chidodo chayalinacho. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Achino ichinu ichinitenda nilonge nawo kwa mifano. Wolola lekeni ng'awakona bae, wotegheletsa lekeni ng'awohulika wala ng'awomanya bae. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na aghala ghalongile nabii Isaya ghatimila kuna wawo,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mtsotegheletsa na ukutegheletsa, lekeni ng'amtsomanya bae.</para>
  <para style="q">Mtsolola na ukulola, lekeni ng'amtsakona bae.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mana imimoyo ye iwanu iwa mitito,</para>
  <para style="q">kwa ghamaghutwi ghawo ng'awohulika pfinoghile bae,</para>
  <para style="q">na tsinenge tsawo wafinyilitsa,</para>
  <para style="q">hela wang'onile kwa tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wang'ahulike kwa ghamaghutwi ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wang'amanyile kwa imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">wang'anihundukile, nani ning'awahonetse.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Lekeni mwemwe mbweda! Kwaapfila tsinenge tsenu tsakona na ghamaghutwi ghenu ghohulika. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, manabii wengi ne iwanu we Imulungu tsawabama ng'ani wone achila chamkona mwemwe, na ukuhulika achila chamuhulika, lekeni ng'awonile bae wala ng'awahulike.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela mana ye ghumfano ghwe imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Lelo mtegheletse mana ya ghumfano ghwe imunu iyohanda. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyohulika imbuli ya undewa lekeni ng'oielewa bae, ayo keghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mnzila. Yehile kakutsa koboka achila ichihandighwe mghati mwake. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu tsila itsilaghalile mna ghamabwe tseghala ne imunu yohulika imbuli na bahala koibokela kwa ndeng'elelo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni kwaapfila kahela imitsitsi, kodudumila chidogho. Ghamaghayo na kudununzika pfing'atsa kwaajili ye imbuli, baho kakughwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne tsimiwa tseghala ne imunu yula iyohulika imbuli, lekeni sang'ano tse ughima uno, na kunoghela sideke utajili woihinya imbuli ayo, nae ng'akweleka bae ghamatunda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo linoghile tseghala ne imunu yula iyohulika imbuli ayo na kuielewa. Hayo kakweleka ghamatunda, yungi mia imwe, hayu sitini na yungi selathini.”</para>
  <para style="s">Undewa we kulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela keli ghumfano ghungi, “Undewa wa kulanga weghala ne imunu yahandile mbeghu inoghile mne mghunda wake. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu hawawasile, mwihile wake katsa, kuya kahanda imighughu mghati mwe uhemba kuya koka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Uhemba hawotile na kwandusa ukweleka, imighughu nayo yoneka mne uhemba. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Watumwa wake wamghendela, wamlongela ‘Imndewa, apfi ng'uhandile mbeghu inoghile mne mghunda wako. Lelo imighughu ilawile kwani?’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kawedika, ‘Mwihile iyo iyatendile apfo.’ Iwatumwa wake wamghutsa ‘Pfii kobama tughende tukaing'ole?’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kawedika, ‘Bae, kwaapfila hamng'ola imighughu, mwodaha kung'ola imighughu hamwe ne uhemba. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mleke pfose pfikule hamwe mbaka ghumsimu ghwa ukusenga. Baho nitsowalongela awala iwosenga, tanu mkunge imighughu, myowe makinzamakinza mkaghalakatse. Kuya mkunge uhemba mkeke mkano mwangu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 4:30-32; Luka 13:18-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela ghumfano ghungi, “Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne imbeghu ndodo ya haladali. Imunu yumwe tsakaisola kaihanda mumghunda mwake. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yenyegho ndodo kubita mbeghu tsose, na haikula, yakuwa ng'ulu kubita imimeya yose ye kumghunda. Yakuwa mbiki, apfo iwapfideghe iwali mlanga wakutsa, wotsenga ipfibali mne ghamaputila ghake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 13:20-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela keli ghumfano ghungi, “Undewa wa kulanga weghala ne hamila iisolighwe ne pinga yumwe na kuhanganya mne utimbo mwingi, nawo wose usasa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ebali Yesu kolangulitsa kwe imifano</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 4:33-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu tsakaghulongela mtingano agha ghose kwa imifano, ng'alongile nawo bae chinu chochose chila bila ya ghumfano. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tsakatenda apfo ghatimile ighalongingwe na nabii.</para>
  <para style="q">“Nitsolonga nawo kwa imifano,</para>
  <para style="q">Nitsoghalonga aghala ighapfisighwe kulawa isi hailumbighwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela mana ye ghumfano ghwe imighughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghuleka mtingano ghwe iwanu kaghenda mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela, wamlongela, “Utulongele ghumfano ghwe imighughu ghutulangulitsa choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Imunu iyahandile imbeghu inoghile iyo Imwana we Imunu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mghunda iyo iisi, na imbeghu inoghile iwo iwana wa undewa we Imulungu, imighughu iwo iwana we ayula Yehile. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na mwihile iyahandile imighughu iyo Setani. Ghamapfuno iwo utsighilo we iisi, na awala iwosenga iwo malaika. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ka imighughu pfaikungighwa na kulakatsighwa mmoto, itsakuwa pfipfo mne utsighilo we iisi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Imwana we Imunu katsowatuma malaika wake, wapfikunge kulawa mne undewa wake apfila pfose ipfiwahonza iwanu watende nzambi na awala wose iwotenda ghehile. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nawo watsowasa mne ghumoto, ako watsolila na kughegheda ghamatsino. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wanoghile watsong'ala ka litsua mne undewa wa Aba wawo. Yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, na yahulike.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye hatsina iipfisighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Undewa wa kulanga weghala na hatsina iipfisighwe mne mghunda. Imunu hayoyona, koipfisa keli. Kwa ndeng'elelo ng'ulu iyali nayo koghenda kuutsa pfose pfayali napfo, kuya kakuya na kughughula mghunda ghula.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghumfano wa lulu inoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Pfipfila undewa wa kulanga weghala ne mchulutsi iyobama lulu inoghile, <verse number="46" style="v"/>hayoyona lulu inoghile sideke, koghenda kuutsa pfinu pfose pfayali napfo, kuya koighula lulu ayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye nyapfu ye ukulowela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Pfipfila undewa wa kulanga weghala ne nyapfu yasighwe mne ibahali, yokunga iwasomba iwanoghile na iwehile. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Haimema, iwanu woikwegha mbaka mmbalimbali mwe ibahali, wokala hasi na kusaghula iwasomba, iwanoghile woweka mseghe, awala iwehile wowasa. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Itsakuwa pfipfo mne utsighilo we iisi, malaika watsakutsa na kuwabaghula iwanu awala wehile kulawa kwe iwanu iwanoghile, <verse number="50" style="v"/>na kuwasa mne ghumoto, ako watsolila na kughegheda ghamatsino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Hatsina ya sambi na ya ghumwande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwoghamanya aghano ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Ona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Naye kawalongela, “Apfo chila mlangulitsi we Ghamalaghitso iyalangusighwe imbuli ye undewa wa kulanga keghala ne imunu yane ing'anda, iyolapfa ipfinu pfa sambi na pfa ghumwande kulawa mne hatsina yake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa ako Natsareti</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:1-6; Luka 4:16-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kuwalongela imifano ino, koka hanu aho, <verse number="54" style="v"/>koya ukaye yake. Kalangulitsa mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela, na awala iwamuhulike wakangawala, weghutsa, “Apfi aipatile kwani ihekima ino na pfinzonza pfino? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ayuno si imwana wa msongola mibiki bae? Angu mai wake si Mariya bae? Na ndughu tsake si tsina Jakobu, Yosefu, Simoni na Yuda bae? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Na lumbu tsake ng'awalibaha na twetwe bae? Lelo aghapatile kwani agha ghose?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Apfo wamhila. Lekeni Yesu kawalongela. “Nabii koteghelesighwa chila hanu, ila ng'oteghelesighwa bae ukaye yake na mng'anda mwake imwenyegho.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Apfo ng'atendile bae pfinu pfingi pfa kukangawatsa ako, kwaapfila tsang'awamtoghole bae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:14-29; Luka 9:7-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mne ghamatsuwa agho, mndewa Herodi tsakahulika mbuli tsa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Apfo kawalongela iwatumwa wake, “Imunu yuno iyo Yohane Mbatitsa, katsilihuka. Apfo ingupfu ye pfinzonza yosang'ana mghati mwake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Herodi tsakamghogha Yohane, kamowa na kumwika mchifungo, kwaajili ya Herodiya, mwehe wa Filipi, ndughu yake, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kwaapfila Yohane tsakamlongela Herodi, “Ng'apfinoghile bae ghweghwe kumkwela Herodiya!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Herodi tsakabama kumkoma Yohane, lekeni tsakapfuka iwanu, kwaapfila tsawamwona ka nabii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mne chihungo cha ukwelekighwa kwa Herodi, neghe Herodiya tsakabigha hambele he iwanu, Herodi tsakanoghelesighwa, <verse number="7" style="v"/>mbaka kamlongela, “Nelaha nitsokwing'a chochose choubama!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa kuwinza ghamalaghitso gha mai wake mwana ayo kalonga. “Ungaye bahano litwi lya Yohane Mbatitsa mlungo.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Imndewa Herodi tsakona usungu sideke, lekeni kwaapfila tsakelaha hambele he iwahenza wake, kalaghitsa yeng'ighwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo Herodi kamtuma imunu yamghane litwi Yohane akula mchifungo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Litwi lyake lighalighwa likighwa mlungo, keng'ighwa imwana ayo, naye kamghalila mai wake. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wa Yohane tsawaghenda walusola lukuli lwake, walutsika, kuya wamlongela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:30-44; Luka 9:10-17; Yohane 6:1-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike achila ichilawile, koka hanu aho kwa ghumnumbwi kaghenda hanu halihela iwanu. Na ghumtingano ghwe iwanu hawahulike, wamuwinza kwa ghamaghulu kulawa mne isi tsawo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulumke mne mnumbwi, kawona ghumtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu, kawonela libatsi, kawahonetsa iwatamu wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nemihe haipfikile, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela, wamlongela, “Hanu hano hose nyika, na litsua liswa, uwaleke iwanu woke waghende mne ipfijiji wakeghulile ipfijo.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ng'awobamighwa bae woke, mwemwe muwenyegho muweng'e ichijo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Tuna pfighate pfitano pfiliyeka ne iwasomba weli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ngalileni hano.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kawalongela iwanu wakale hasi mne imitsani. Kasola pfighate pfila pfitano ne iwasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki kapfibena pfighate pfila. Kuya kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, nawo waweng'a iwanu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwanu wose waja, weghuta. Na iwanang'ina wake wadondola pfighate ipfisighale, wamemesa pfiseghe kumi na pfili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwamale iwajile tsawang'ali wopfika elufu tano, iwapinga ne iwana ng'awapetighwe bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:45-52; Yohane 6:15-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yowaagha iwanu, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake wadine mne mnumbwi wamlongole kuloka kumwambu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hayamalitse kuwaagha iwanu, kagheluka mchidunda kulomba. Nemihe haipfikile, kakala ako yaliyeka, <verse number="24" style="v"/>na mnumbwi tsa ghwa kutali na kumwani ghwotowighwa na ghamawimbi, kwaapfila inyahemu tsaikala yoghukunughitsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Habehi na ukucha, Yesu kawaghendela, aku koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake hawamwonile koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi, tsawapfuka. Walonga, “Ghumtsimu!” Wakemelela kwa kupfuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni bahala Yesu kawalongela, “Mwinyamale! Na nene. Mleke kupfuka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petiri kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, ka ghweghwe, unongele nitse kuna ghweghwe kwa kughenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Haya utse!”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri kahulumka mne ghumnumbwi, kaghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi kumghendela Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni hayonile inyahemu, kapfuka kandusa kutsama, kalila, “Imtwatsa, nikombole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake kamkinda. Kamlongela, “Ghweghwe yutoghola chidogho, ebali upfuka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nawo hawadinile mne mnumbwi, inyahemu nayo inyamala. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na awala iwakalile mne ghumnumbwi, wamtamanila, walonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imtamu ako Genesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 6:53-56)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hawalokile tsimbu na kupfika isi ya Genesareti. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Na iwanu iwali mne isi ila hawamtangile Yesu, watsenetsa mbuli tsake mne isi tsose, apfo wamuhilikila iwatamu wawo wose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wamlomba yawalekele iwatamu wakinde mindo ye lighwanda lyake. Na wose iwalikindile tsawahona.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ichinoghile na ichihile</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 7:1-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Mafarisayo ne iwalangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso iwalawile Yerusalemu wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ebali iwanang'ina wako ng'awokinda bae ipfihendo pfe iwabala wetu? Hawakuja ng'awohopfugha bae pfinoghile ghamoko ghawo!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ebali mwemwe ng'amkinda bae malaghitso ghe Imulungu ila mwopfiwinza ipfihendo pfenu? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu kalonga, ‘Umtegheletse aba wako na mai wako,’ na ‘Imunu wowose iyomligha aba wake au mai wake ayo yakomighwe.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mwolonga, ka imunu kana ichinu chochose ichidaha kumwapfila aba wake au mai wake, lekeni kolonga, ‘Ichinu chino nimlapfila Imulungu,’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>imunu ayo ng'obamighwa bae kumtegheletsa aba wake. Apfo pfipfo pfamuibetsa imbuli ye Imulungu kwa kuwinza ipfihendo pfenu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwa wang'enye! Nabii Isaya tsakatabili ghoya, hayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>‘Iwanu wano wonipfuka kwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q">lekeni imimoyo yawo yakutali na nene.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wonitamanila hela,</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila wolangulitsa ghamalaghitso ghe iwanu ka ghamalaghitso ghangu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Aghala ighomtenda imunu yehe</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 7:14-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kaghukema ghumtingano ghwe iwanu, kawalongela, “Mtegheletse mpfimanye! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Achila ichikwingila mumlomo mwe imunu ng'achidaha bae kumtenda ‘yehe.’ Lekeni achila ichilawa kunze mwe mlomo we imunu, acho chomtenda ‘yehe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamghutsa, “Apfi komanya ka Mafarisayo hawahulike imbuli ino tsawona maya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Chila mbiki ing'aghuhandighwe ne Aba wangu iyali kulanga ghutsong'olighwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muwaleke awo, iwalongotsa pfifita. Ichifita ang'amlongotsa ichifita miyaghe, ambe wose weli watsakughwila mpondo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela, “Utulongele mana ye ghumfano ghuno.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi namwe mwose mng'ali ng'ammanyile bae? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka ichinu chochose ichikwingila mumlomo mwe imunu chobitila munda, kuya choghenda kucholo? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni aghala igholawa mumlomo, gholawa mghati mwe ghumoyo, agho ghagho ighomtenda imunu yehe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mne ghumoyo gholawa ghamawatso ghehile na ukukoma na ughoni, ughutsu, ukulonga ung'enye na ubapfi na maligho. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Aghano ghomtenda imunu yehe, lekeni ukuja na ghamoko ghang'ahopfughighwe pfinoghile ng'akumtenda bae imunu yehe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola kwe ipinga</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 7:24-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu koka hanu hala, kaghenda mne isi ya Tiro na Sidoni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ipinga yumwe Mkananayo tsayang'ali yokala habehi na isi atso kamghendela Yesu aku kokemelela, “Imtwatsa, Imwana wa Daudi, umbonele libatsi! Mwanangu kana chinyamkela, koghaya ng'ani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ng'edike chochose bae. Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela, wamlomba, “Mlongele yoke kwaapfila kotuwinza na kokemelela kuchughu kwetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Tsanitumighwa kwe iwanu wa Isiraeli waliheka iwaghile ka iwang'olo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamghendela kamtowela ghamaghoti, kalonga, “Imtwatsa, unyapfile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Ng'apfinoghile bae kusola ichijo che iwana na kuwasila wambwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kalonga, “Ona, Imtwatsa, lekeni hata iwambwa wakuja ipfijo ipfilaghala mmetsa mwe iwatwatsa wawo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa mai yutoghola ghendo! Kutsotendelighwa chaubamile.” Bahala imwanaghe kahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu tsakoka hanu hala, kaghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu Galilaya. Kuya kagheluka kuchidando, kakala hasi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>ghumtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu ghumghendela na kumuhilikila ipfimbete na ipfifita na ipfibubu na iwanu iwaholole, ne iwanu wengi iwoghula, wamwikila hambele hake. Naye kawahonetsa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iwanu tsawakangawala hawonile ipfibubu wolonga, iwaholole wahona, ipfimbete woghenda na ipfifita wakona. Nawo wamtunitsa Imulungu wa Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghwing'a ichijo ghumtingano ghungi ghwe iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake, kawalongela, “Nowonela libatsi iwanu wano, kwaapfila wakala na nene kwa ghamatsuwa madatu na wahela chokuja. Kuya sibama bae niwaleke woke ne inzala, kwaapfila watsotsilika mnzila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Akuno kunyika twodaha kupata kwani ichijo cha ukuwaghutitsa iwanu wose wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Saba na iwasomba wadowado chidogho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanu wakale hasi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kapfisola pfighate pfila saba na iwasomba, kapfibaliki, kapfibena kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, nawo wawagholela iwanu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wose tsawaja na kwighuta. Kuya iwanang'ina wake wadondola ipfiseghe saba ipfimemile pfighate ipfisighale. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iwamale iwajile tsawapetighwa, tsawakala elufu nne, iwapinga ne iwana ng'awapetighwe bae. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuya kawaleka iwanu woke, kadina mne mnumbwi, kaghenda mne isi ya Magadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo womlomba Yesu atende pfinzonza</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:11-13; Luka 12:54-56)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafarisayo na Masadukayo wamghendela Yesu, wamghetsa kwa kumghutsa yawalanguse chitango kulawa kulanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Litsuwa halikuswa, mwolonga, ‘Kutsonogha, kwaapfila mlanga kudung'u.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na nemitondo mwolonga, ‘Leloli imvula yotowa, kwaapfila mlanga kudung'u na libingu litegha.’ Mwodaha kutanga mlanga pfakuli, lekeni ng'amdaha bae kutanga ipfitango pfe ghamatsuwa agha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mweleko ghwihile na ing'aghutoghola ghobama ipfitango! Lekeni ng'amtsakwing'ighwa ichitango kubita achila cha Yona.” Kuya Yesu kawaleka, koka.</para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:14-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hawalokile tsimbu, iwanang'ina wake tsawatanga ka wesemwa kusola pfighate. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwalangitse, mwilolese ne hamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wandusa ukwighutsa iwenyegho kwa iwenyegho, “Kolonga apfi kwaapfila ng'atughalile chighate chochose bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya achila chawang'ali wolonga, apfo kawaghutsa, “Mwemwe yamtoghola chidogho, ule mwighutsa iwenyegho kwa iwenyegho kwaapfila mwahela pfighate? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Angu mng'ali ng'ammanyile bae? Pfii mwisemwa hala hanibenile pfighate pfitano kwe iwanu elufu tano? Tsammemetse ipfiseghe pfingapi ipfisighale? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na apfila pfighate saba kwe iwanu elufu nne? Tsammemetse pfiseghe pfingapi ipfisighale? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka sing'ali nilonga tsimbuli tse pfighate? Mwalangitse ne hamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wamanya ghendo ka Yesu ng'awalongele bae walangitse ne hamila ye pfighate, ila walangitse na ghamalangulitso gha Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri komtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:27-30; Luka 9:18-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu hayapfikile mne isi ye Kaisariya Filipi, kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake “Angu iwanu wolonga Imwana we Imunu nani?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Iwanu wangi wolonga Yohane Mbatitsa, wangi wolonga Eliya, wangi wolonga Yeremiya au yumwe wa nabii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Namwe mlongatse, mwolonga nene nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu Imkombotsi, Imwana we Imulungu iyali mghima!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kubweda ghweghwe Simoni, imwana wa Yohane, kwaapfila achino chaulongile ng'ulangusighwe ne imunu bae, ila chilawila kwa Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na nene nokulongela, Petiri, ghweghwe kwa bambalawe na mchanya mwe bambalawe lino nitsotsenga kanisa lyangu, na hata lifwa ng'alitsodaha bae kulihinya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nitsokwing'a tsifughulo tsa undewa wa kulanga. Chinu chochose chauhinda muisi chitsohindighwa kulanga, na chochose chaufughula muisi, chitsofughulighwa kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghoma iwanang'ina wake waleke kuwalongela iwanu ka yeye tsakakala Kiristu Imkombotsi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli yake ya kughaya na ukufa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 8:31-9:1; Luka 9:22-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kulawa baho Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake mwatsimwatsi, “Nobamighwa ng'ende Yerusalemu na kudununzika ng'ani mne ghamoko ghe iwakulu, watambika wakulu ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Kuya nitsokomighwa, lekeni mne litsuwa lya kadatu nitsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Petiri kamsola Yesu hambalimbali kandusa kumkembela, “Bae, Imtwatsa! Aghano ghaleke kukulawila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kahunduka, kamlongela Petiri, “Uke kuchughu kwangu, Setani! Ghweghwe kwa ng'walo kuna nene, kwaapfila ghamawatso ghako ng'agholawa bae kwe Imulungu, ila gha chimunu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Imunu wowose iyobama kuniwinza, yeleme imwenyegho, yasole ghumsalaba ghwake yaniwinze. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake, katsowaghitsa, lekeni munu wowose iyowaghitsa ughima kwaajili yangu katsowona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfi imunu katsobweda choni ang'apata isi yose, lekeni kowaghitsa ughima wake? Au imunu katsolapfa choni yapate keli ughima wake? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa mne utunitso wa Aba wake hamwe ne malaika wake, kuya katsomghweka chila imunu kwa achila chayatendile. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, iwanu wangi iwemile hano, ng'awatsokufa bae mbaka wamwone Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mne undewa wake.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghaluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:2-13; Luka 9:28-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Haghabitile matsuwa sita, Yesu kamsola Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane ndughu yake Jakobu, kaghenda nawo waliyeka mchidando mwe chidunda chitali. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wolola, bahala Yesu kaghaluka. Chihanga chake tsaching'ala ka litsua, na ghamaghwanda ghake ghawa matselu chwee ka ghumwanga! <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Musa na Eliya walawila, walonga naye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Mndewa, pfinogha twetwe kukala hano! Ung'abama nene nitsosenga pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe chako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hayang'ali yolonga, libingu iling'alile liwaghubika, na litsi kulawa mne libingu lila lilonga, “Ayuno Mwanangu iyoninoghela, nonoghelighwa naye. Mumtegheletse!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina hawahulike apfo, wapfuka ng'ani, watowa maghoti wenama mbaka pfihanga pfawo pfidonza hasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghendela kawaghutsa, kawalongela, “Mwinuke, mleke kupfuka!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hawalolile kuchanya, ng'awonile imunu bae ila Yesu yaliheka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wohulumka mchidando, Yesu kawalaghitsa, “Mleke kumlongela imunu wowose achila chamwonile mbaka Imwana we Imunu hayatsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wamghutsa, “Lelo ule iwalangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Eliya kobamighwa tanu yatse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Tanu Eliya kakutsa ghendo. Naye katsokwika ghoya ipfinu pfose. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nowalongelani, Eliya ma katsa, ila ng'awamtangile bae. Nawo wamtendela ghose ghawabamile. Pfipfila watsomdununza Imwana we Imunu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina tsawamanya ka Yesu yang'ali yowalongela mbuli tsa Yohane Mbatitsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo iyane chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:14-29; Luka 9:37-43a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hawapfikile mne mtingano we iwanu, imunu yumwe kamghendela Yesu, kamtowela ghamaghoti, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kalonga, “Imtwatsa, umwonele libatsi mwanangu, kana chisala na kodununzighwa ng'ani. Kwaapfila kakughwagha mne ghumoto au mne ghamatsi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nimghala kuna iwanang'ina wako, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kumhonetsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Mwemwe mweleko ing'aghutoghola, na ighwihile! Nitsokala na mwemwe mbaka tsuwachi? Nitsowadudumila mwemwe mbaka tsuwachi? Mngalile hano imsongolo ayo!” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kamkembela chinyamkela, na chinyamkela kamlawa imsongolo ayo. Bahala imsongolo ayo kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wamghendela Yesu chinyelenyele, wamghutsa, “Ule ng'atudahile bae kumlapfa chinyamkela yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Kwaapfila mwotoghola chidogho. Nowalongelani ghendo, ka ukutoghola kwenu kung'awile kudodo ka imbeghu ya haladali, mng'adahile kuchilongela chidunda chino, ‘Ulawe hano, ughende kula,’ nacho ching'aghendile. Wala ng'akutsokuwa ne ichinu chochose ing'achidahika kuna mwemwe.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni ichinyamkela ka yuno ng'odaha bae kulawa kwa inzila yoyose, ila kwa ukulomba na ukufunga ukuja.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga keli imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:30-32; Luka 9:43b-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wose hawapfikile Galilaya, Yesu kawalongela, “Imwana we Imunu katsoghoghighwa ne iwanu, <verse number="23" style="v"/>nawo watsomkoma, ila mne litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">Iwanang'ina wake wona usungu sideke.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi ye Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawapfikile Kaperinaumu, iwasola kodi ye ing'anda ye Imulungu wamghendela Petiri wamghutsa, “Apfi imlangulitsi wako koliha kodi ye ing'anda ye Imulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petiri kawedika, “Ona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri hayengile mng'anda, Yesu kandusa kulonga, “Simoni ukonatse? Iwandewa we isi wosola kodi au maliho kwe iwanu wachi, kwe iwana wawo au kwe iwahenza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Petiri kamwidika, “Kwe iwahenza.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kedika, “Pfinogha, apfo iwanu wawo ng'awobamighwa kuliha bae. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni, ng'atubama bae kuwadesa iwanu wano, ghenda kune tsimbu, wase ludodi lwako. Umsole isomba yula yulongole kumlowa, umwasame mlomo ghwake kuya kutsakona isendi. Isole ukaweng'e kwaajili ya kodi yangu na yako.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yuhi iyali mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:33-37; Luka 9:46-48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bahala iwanang'ina wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Yuhi iyali mkulu mne undewa wa kulanga?” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kamkema imwana mdodo, kamwika haghati hawo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, ka ng'amghaluka bae na kwighala ne iwana wadodo, ng'amtsakwingila mbe mne undewa wa kulanga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo imunu wowose yehulumsa mwenyegho ka imwana yuno, hayo iyo imkulu mne undewa wa kulanga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na imunu wowose iyombokela imwana mdodo ka yuno kwa taghwa lyangu, ayo kombokela nene.</para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfimhonza imunu yatende nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 9:42-48; Luka 17:1-2)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Lekeni imunu wowose yomhonza yumwe we iwana wano iwonitoghola nene yatende nzambi, ng'apfu yohighwe libwe lya kusaghila msingo na yasighwe mwibahali mne ghamatsi ighaghendese.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="18:6">1. Iwanu weli wosaghila libwe lyo ukusaghila</figure> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iisi yose itsoghaya kwaajili ya aghala ighowahonza iwanu waghitse ukutoghola kwawo! Agho ghatsolawila, lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula iyoghatenda ghalawile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ka ghumoko ghwako au mghulu ghwako ghwokuhonza utende ghehile, ughane ughwase kutali naghwe. Ng'apfu wingile mne ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose aku kuhungukighwa na ghumoko au mghulu, kubita ukwasighwa mne ghumoto ghwa ghamatsuwa ghose aku kuna ghamoko meli na maghulu ghako meli. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inenge yako ing'akuhonza utende ghehile, uing'ole uyase kutali naghwe! Ng'apfu wingile mne ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose aku kuna inenge imwe kubita kwasighwa mne ghumoto aku kuna nenge mbili.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ng'olo yaghile</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 15:3-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Mwalangitse mleke kumbetsa yumwe we iwana wano wadodo. Kwaapfila, nowalongelani wamalaika wawo ako kulanga ghamatsuwa ghose wa hambele ha Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsa kuwakombola awala iwaghile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Mkonatse? Ka imunu kana iwang'olo mia imwe, kuya yumwe kagha, apfi ng'atsowaleka bae awala tisini na tisa kulughongo na kughenda kumbama ayula iyaghile? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, ang'amwona, katsomdeng'elela ng'ani kubita awala tisini na tisa yang'awaghile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pfipfila Aba wenu iyali kulanga ng'obama bae yumwe we iwadodo wano yaghe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukumwapfila ndughu iyatendile nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ndughu yako ang'akutendela ghehile, ughende ukamkanye totso lyake, ghweghwe na yeye mliyeka. Ang'akutegheletsa, katsakuwa ndughu yako keli. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni ang'alema kukutegheletsa, umsole imunu yumwe au weli hamwe naghwe, ili ‘kwa iwakalangama weli au wadatu ghomba lilamlighwe,’ ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ang'alema kuwategheletsa ulilongele kanisa, na ka kolema kuwategheletsa iwanu we Imulungu, kuna ghweghwe mleke yawe ka imunu ing'ammanyile Imulungu au imsola kodi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nowalongelani ghendo, ghoghose ghamuhinda muisi ghatsohindighwa kulanga, na ghoghose ghampfughula muisi, ghatsopfughulighwa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Nowalongelani keli, ka weli wenu wetoghola muisi kulomba ichinu chochose, Aba wangu iyali kulanga katsowatendela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hanu hohose hawetingana iwanu weli au wadatu kwa taghwa lyangu, Nene nahamwe nawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwaleghusila ghamatotso iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuya Petiri kamghendela Yesu, kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, apfi ndughu yangu ang'anitendela ghamatotso, nitsomlekelela mala ngapi? Hata mala saba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela si mala saba bae, ila saba mala sabini, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kwaapfila undewa we Imulungu weghala na Imndewa yumwe iyabamile kukaghula tsisendi tsake tsawalinatso iwatumwa wake. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hayanduse kupeta, kaghalighwa imunu yumwe iyang'ali yomdahi sendi milioni nyingi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Naye kwaapfila tsakahela chinu che ukuliha, imndewa kalaghitsa yahutsighwe, yeye, mwehe wake ne iwanaghe na pfose pfayalinapfo, ili yalihe deni. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfo imtumwa ayo katowa ghamaghoti hambele hake, kalonga, ‘Unidudumile, nitsokuliha chila chinu.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imndewa yula kamwonela libatsi, kamleghusila deni lila, kamleka yoke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Lekeni imunu ayo koka, kuya ketingana ne imtumwa miyaghe iyang'ali yomdahi sendi chidogho. Kamghogha kamkinda halumelo. Kalonga, ‘Unilihe sendi tsangu!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Imtumwa miyaghe kamtowela ghamaghoti, kamlomba, ‘Unidudumile, nitsokuliha.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni yeye kalema, kaghenda kumwika miyaghe mchifungo, mbaka hayatsoliha deni lila. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iwatumwa wangi hawonile achila ichilawile, wasing'inika sideke, waghenda kumlongela imndewa chila chinu ichilawile. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kuya imndewa kamkema mng'anda imtumwa ayo, kamlongela, ‘Ghweghwe imtumwa wihile. Nikuleghusila deni lyose kwaapfila tsakunilomba nitende apfo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tsakubamighwa umwonele libatsi imtumwa miyagho ka nene pfanikwonele libatsi.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Apfo imndewa ayo kona maya sideke, kamwika mchifungo yadununzighwe mbaka hayatsoliha deni lyose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi pfifo Aba wangu iyali kulanga pfayatsowatendelani mng'aleka kuwaleghusila wandughu tsenu ghamatotso ghawo kulawa mne mimoyo yenu.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukwileka</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga mbuli atso, kalawa isi ya Galilaya kaghenda mne isi ya Yudeya, kumwambu kwe ghumto Yoridani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wamuwinza, naye kawahonetsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela Yesu wamghetse. Wamghutsa, “Angu pfinogha immale kumleka mwehe wake kwa totso lyolyose?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ng'amsomile bae mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, ka kulawa mwanduso Imulungu tsakalumba immale ne ipinga? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo Imulungu kalonga, ‘Kwa ichinu chino, mmale katsomleka aba wake na mai wake, katselunga na mwehe wake, nawo weli watsokuwa lukuli lumwe?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo si weli keli, ila lukuli lumwe. Apfo chayalungile Imulungu, imunu yaleke kuchibaghula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wamghutsa, “Ebali lelo Musa tsakalaghitsa immale yamwing'e mwehe wake talaka na kumleka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Musa tsakawalekelela muwaleke wehe tsenu kwaapfila imimoyo yenu mikomu. Lekeni ng'aiwile pfino bae kulawa mwanduso. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nowalongelani, imunu wowose iyomleka mwehe wake, ila kwa ughoni, na ukukwela ipinga yungi, ayo kotenda ughoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamlongela, “Ka apfo pfipfo pfaili kwe immale na mwehe wake. Ng'apfu kuleka ukukwelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Si chila imunu bae iyodaha kuitoghola mbuli ino, ila awala iweng'ighwe ne Imulungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuna ipfinu pfingi ipfiwatenda iwamale waleke kukwela, kwaapfila wamwenga welekighwa pfipfo, na wamwenga watendighwa apfo ne iwanu. Wamwenga ng'awokwela bae kwaajili ye undewa wa kulanga. Imunu iyodaha kuitoghola imbuli ino, leka yaitoghole.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowabaliki iwana wadowado</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:13-16; Luka 18:15-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wangi wamghalila Yesu iwana wadowado awekile ghamoko na kuwalombela, lekeni iwanang'ina wake wawakembela iwanu awo iwawaghalile iwana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Muwaleke iwana wadowado watse kuna nene, mleke kuwaghoma kwaapfila undewa wa kulanga wa iwanu iwali ka iwana wano.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawekila ghamoko, kuya koka hanu aho.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbwanga tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:17-31; Luka 18:18-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe kamghendela Yesu kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, angu nende choni chinoghile ili niubokele ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ebali kwonighutsa imbuli ye ichinu chinoghile? Hana yumwe yaliyeka iyanoghile. Ung'abama kwingila mne ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, ughakinde ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imunu yula kamghutsa, “Ghamalaghitso ghachi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Aghano, uleke kukoma, uleke ughoni, uleke ubapfi na uleke kulonga ughutsu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>uwategheletse aba wako na mai wako, umnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela ghumwenyegho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imsongolo yula kamlongela, “Agha ghose nighakinda. Lelo nitende choni keli?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ung'abama kuwa imunu yatimilike, ughende ukautse ipfinu pfako pfose, uweng'e tsisendi iwahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa na hatsina kulanga. Kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imsongolo yula hayahulike apfo, koka kwa usungu, kwaapfila tsakana mali nyingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Nowalongela ghendo, itsakuwa pfikomu kwa tajiri kwingila mne undewa wa kulanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya nowalongelani, pfibewe kwe ingamiya kwingila mchonzo mwe sindano, kubita tajiri kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake hawahulike apfo, wakangawala ghendo, wamghutsa, “Lelo yuhi iyodaha kukombolighwa?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola kuya kawalongela, “Kwe imunu chinu chino ng'achidahika bae, lekeni kwe Imulungu ghose ghodahika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petiri kamwidika, “Tuleka chila chinu twokuwinza ghweghwe. Lelo tutsopata choni?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, mne isi iikutsa, Imwana we Imunu hayatsokala hane chighoda chake cha utunitso, mwemwe imniwinzile nene pfipfila mtsokala mne pfighoda kumi na pfili, kughahigha makabila kumi na meli gha Isiraeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na imunu wowose iyalekile tsing'anda, au kaka tsake, au lumbu tsake, au aba wake, au mai wake, au iwanaghe, au imighunda yake kwaajili yangu, ayo katsobokela mala kumi, na katsohala ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni awala wa mwanduso watsakuwa wa utsighilo, na wautsighilo watsakuwa wamwanduso.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwosang'ana mne mghunda ghwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne imunu yane mghunda, iyalawile lupfilipfili kaghenda kubama iwanu wakasang'ane mne mghunda ghwake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Katoghola kuwaliha sendi tsa litsuwa limwe, kuya kawaghala mne mghunda ghwake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Masaa madatu hambele koka keli, kawona iwanu wangi wema mne ghulilo wahela sang'ano. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kawalongela, ‘Mwemwe mwose mghende mne mghunda ghwangu mkasang'ane, nitsowaliha pfinoghile.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nawo waghenda. Kuya kaghenda keli saa sita na saa tisa, katenda pfipfila. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Haipfikile saa kumi na imwe koka keli, kawona iwanu wangi wema hane ghulilo, kawaghutsa, ‘Ebali mwimile hano misi yose bila sang'ano?’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwanu awo wamwidika, ‘Kwaapfila haduhu imunu iyatwing'ile sang'ano.’ Kawalongela, ‘Namwe pfipfila mghende mkasang'ane mne mghunda ghwangu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nemihe haipfikile, imunu yane mghunda kamlongela mwimilitsi wake, ‘Uwakeme iwanu iwasang'ane, uwalihe sendi tsawo, wanduse na wautsighilo kuya awala iwalongole.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwanu iwasang'ane kwandusila saa kumi na imwe hawatsile, chila munu kabokela malilho gha litsuwa limwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo awala iwalongole kusang'ana hawatsile, tsawalolela kubokela sendi nyingi, lekeni chila munu kabokela dinali imwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hawabokele maliho ghawo, wandusa kumsing'inikila ayula yane mghunda. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Walonga, ‘Iwanu wano iwatsile kusang'ana nemihe, wasang'ana kwa saa limwe liliheka, lekeni kuwaliha ka pfautulihe twetwe itusang'ane misi yose mlutsua.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Naye kamwidika yumwe wawo, ‘Sale yangu, sikubunzile bae. Apfi ghweghwe ng'utoghole kusang'ana kwa malilho gha litsuwa limwe? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lelo usole ichili chako uke. Nene nobama kumwing'a ayula wa utsighilo ka pfanikwing'ile ghweghwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Angu ng'apfinoghile bae nene kutenda achila chanibama kwa sendi tsangu mwenyegho? Au kwakona chepfu kwaapfila nene namluso?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamalitsa kwa ukulonga, “Apfo, wa utsighilo katsakuwa wa mwanduso, na ayula wamwanduso katsakuwa wautsighilo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwakadatu imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:32-34; Luka 18:31-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda Yerusalemu kawasola iwanang'ina kumi na weli waliyeka, kawalongela, <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mlole, twogheluka Yerusalemu, ako Imwana we Imunu katsakwing'ighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwatambika wakulu ne iwalangulitsi we ghamalaghitso. Nawo watsomhigha yakomighwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya watsomghala kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi, nawo watsombetsa, watsomtsipula na watsomkoma kwa kumuwamba mna msalaba, lekeni ghamatsuwa madatu hambele katsotsilihuka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mai wawo Jakobu na Yohane kowalombela ukulu iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:35-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya mai we iwana wa Sebedayo kamghendela Yesu hamwe ne iwanaghe, katowa ghamaghoti, kamlomba amtendele choyobama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Ubama choni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Chondechonde, ulaghitse wanangu wano weli wakale ubali wako wa kujilo na wa kumoso mne undewa wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'ammanyile bae achila chamlomba. Angu mwodaha kunwela ichikombe chanitsonwela nene?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Twodaha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mtsonwela ghendo ichikombe changu, lekeni kukala kumoso au kukala kujilo, si sang'ano yangu bae. Lekeni chinu acho watsakwing'ighwa awala iwasaghulighwe na Aba wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina kumi hawahulike apfo, tsawawonela maya awala wandughu weli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawakema, kawalongela, “Mwomanya ka iwabala we iwanu iwali si Wayahudi wowalongotsa iwanu wawo kwa ingupfu, na pfilongotsi wawo wana ukulu kuna wawo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lekeni ileke kuwa apfo kuna mwemwe, ila imunu wowose iyobama kuwa imkulu mghati mwenu, yawe mtumwa wenu, <verse number="27" style="v"/>na imunu wowose iyobama kuwa wa mwanduso kobamighwa yawe mtumwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pfipfo ka Imwana we Imunu, ng'atsile bae kutumikighwa, ila kutumikila na kulapfa ughima wake kuwakombola iwanu wengi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa pfifita weli</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 10:46-52; Luka 18:35-43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali wakuka Yeriko, iwanu wengi tsawamuwinza. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pfifita weli iwang'ali wokala mmbalimbali mwe inzila hawahulike Yesu kobita, wandusa kukemelela, “Imtwatsa, Mwana wa Daudi, utwonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iwanu wawakembela wawalongela wanyamale, lekeni waghendelela kukemelela, “Imtwatsa, Mwana wa Daudi utwonele libatsi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kema, kawakema kawaghutsa, “Mwobama niwatendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Imtwatsa, twobama twone!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawonela libatsi, katsikinda nenge tsawo, bahala wadaha ukwona, nawo wamuwinza.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa indeng'elo</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 11:1-11; Luka 19:28-40; Yohane 12:12-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali habehi na Yerusalemu na kupfika Betifage mne Chidunda cha Mitseituni, kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Mghende mbaka mne kaye ili hambele henu, baho mtsomwona ipunda kohighwa hamwe ne imwanaghe, muwadohole mngalile hano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'awalongela chochose, mumlongele, ‘Imtwatsa kowabama,’ naye katsowaleka mke.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Achino chilawila ili aghala ighalongighwe na manabii ghatimile. <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Umlongele neghe Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">Lola, Mndewa wako kokutsila,</para>
  <para style="q">Kahola na kadina ipunda, imwanapunda, imwana we ipunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo iwanang'ina waghenda watenda ka Yesu pfayawalongele. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wamghala ipunda ne imwana we ipunda, weka ghamaghwanda ghawo mchanya mwe punda awo, na Yesu kakala mchanya mwake. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wagheka ghamaghwanda ghawo mnzila na wangi waghana milala wanzasa mnzila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na iwanu iwamlongole na awala iwamuwinzile wose wandusa kukemelela, walonga, “Yatogholighwe, Imwana wa Daudi! Imulungu kambaliki ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa! Yatogholighwe Imulungu yali kuchanya kulanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu hayengile Yerusalemu, iwanu wose wakangawala, weghutsa, “Ayu nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iwanu wawedika, “Ayuno nabii, Yesu wa Natsareti ya Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mne ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 11:15-19; Luka 19:45-48; Yohane 2:13-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu kawawinga wose awala iwang'ali woghula na iwang'ali wohutsa. Katsibindula tsimetsa tsawo tsa ukubenela tsisendi na ipfighoda pfa awala iwang'ali woutsa iwanjiwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa, ‘Ing'anda yangu itsokemighwa ing'anda ya ukulombela.’ Lekeni mwemwe mwoitenda iwe mango ye iwabapfi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ipfifita na ipfimbete wamghendela Yesu mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, naye kawahonetsa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni iwatambika wakulu na iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso tsawona maya hawonile pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile Yesu, ne iwana pfawakemelele mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, “Yatogholighwe Imwana wa Daudi!” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi kohulika chawolonga iwana wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kawedika, “Ona, ng'amsomile bae? ‘Kwa milomo ye iwana wadowado ne iwana iwakong'a kwotogholighwa ghendo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawaleka kaghenda Betaniya, kunze kwe ghumji, kawasa kuko.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koulighita mbiki</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 11:12-14,20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nemitondo lupfilipfili, Yesu hayang'ali kakuya mne ghumji, tsakona inzala. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kaghwona mbiki mmbalimbali mwe inzila, kaghughendela lekeni ng'onile chochose bae ila imitsani iliyeka. Apfo kaghulongela, “Uleke ukweleka keli ghamatunda!” Bahala mbiki ghula ghunyala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake hawonile apfo wakangawala, wamghutsa, “Ule mbiki ghuno ghusumka kunyala?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongelani ghendo mng'atoghola na kuleka kwalangula, mwodaha kutenda si achila chiliyeka ichanendile mne mbiki, ila mwodaha kuchilongela chidunda chino, ‘Wibule, wikeyase mwibahali,’ kuya itsakuwa pfipfo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mng'atoghola, chochose chamlomba mtsobokela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu woghutsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 11:27-33; Luka 20:1-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na hayang'ali yolangulitsa, iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu we iwanu wamghendela, wamghutsa, “Kwa ukulu wachi kotenda ghano ghose? Yuhi yakwing'ile ukulu uno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Na nene nitsowaghutsa imbuli imwe, mng'anyidika, nitsowalongela notenda ghano kwa ukulu wachi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfi ubatitso wa Yohane ulawile kwani? Tsaulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wandusa kwighutsa iwenyegho kwe iwenyegho walonga, “Tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kulanga,’ katsotughutsa, ‘Ule lelo ng'amumtoghole Yohane?’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lekeni tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kwe iwanu,’ twopfuka iwanu, kwaapfila wose tsawatoghola Yohane kakala nabii.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apfo wamwidika Yesu, “Ng'atumanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">Naye kawedika, “Na nene siwalongela bae kwa ukulu wachi notenda ipfinu apfi.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwana weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mkonatse? Imunu yumwe tsakana iwana weli, kaghenda kwa ayula mwana mkulu kamlongela, ‘Mwanangu, leloli ughende ukasang'ane mne mghunda.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Naye kamwidika, ‘Sighenda bae,’ lekeni hambele chidogho kaghaluka kaghenda. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuya aba ayo kamghendela imwana wa keli, kamlongela ichinu chichila. Naye kamwidika, ‘Ona aba,’ lekeni ng'aghendile bae. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lelo yuhi mna iwana wano weli iyatendile achila chayabamile aba wake?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Imwana imkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, iwasola kodi na iwaghoni watsowalongola kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yohane tsakatsa kuwalangusa inzila inoghile, namwe ng'amumtoghole bae, lekeni iwasola kodi na iwaghoni wamtoghola. Namwe hata hamwonile apfo, ng'amghaluke bae na kumtoghola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mghunda ghwa mitsabibu ne iwanu iwolima</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:1-12; Luka 20:9-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Mtegheletse imbuli ingi, imunu yumwe yane ing'anda kahanda tsabibu mne mghunda. Kaghuteghela luwa mghunda agho, kahimba lipondo lya ukukamila tsabibu, katsenga ghumnala, kawakodishila iwanu iwolima, kuya koka ghumwanza. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa gha ukupfuna haghapfikile, kawatuma iwatumwa wake wakasole tsabibu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hawala iwanu iwolima wawaghogha iwatumwa wake, yumwe wamtowa, yungi wamkoma, na yungi wamtowa na ghamabwe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya tsakawatuma keli watumwa wangi, tsawengi kubita awala wamwanduso, na iwanu wala iwolima wawatendela pfipfila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hawamalile wose ghendo, kamtuma imwanaghe kuna wawo, kalonga, ‘Watsomtegheletsa mwanangu.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu iwolima hawamwonile, welongela iwenyegho, ‘Ayuno iye muhala, mtse tumkome tusole uhala wake!’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Apfo wamghogha, wamwasa kunze kwe mghunda ghwe imitsabibu, wamkoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Lelo, imunu yane mghunda hayatsakutsa, yatsowatenda choni awala iwanu iwolima?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Katsowakoma ghendo iwanu awo wehile, katsoweka iwanu wangi mne mghunda aghwo, nawo watsomgholela tsitsabibu mne ghamatsuwa ghe kupfuna.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'amsomile bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe ililemighwe na iwatsengagha</para>
  <para style="q">liwa libwe kulu lye lukwalambatsa.</para>
  <para style="q">Imbuli ino ilawa kwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">nayo yotukangawatsa.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Apfo nowalongelani ghendo, undewa we Imulungu utsobokighwa kuna mwemwe na kwing'ighwa iwanu iwakweleka ghamatunda ghake, awala iwotenda aghala ghobama Imulungu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Na ayula iyakughwa mchanya mwe libwe lino katsobeneka beneka, na wowose ilitsomghwila litsomhonda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Watambika wakulu na Mafarisayo hawahulike apfo, tsawamanya Yesu tsaang'ali yowalonga wawo. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Apfo wabama inzila ya kumghoghela, lekeni wapfuka iwanu, kwaapfila iwanu tsawamona Yesu tsakakala nabii.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya ichihungo cha ukukwela</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 14:15-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela keli iwanu kwa imbuli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne Imndewa iyamtendele mwanaghe chihungo cha ukukwela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawatuma iwatumwa wake wawalongele awala iwakemighwe watse kune chihungo, lekeni walema ukutsa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuya kawatuma iwatumwa wangi, kalonga, ‘Muwalongele pfino awala iwakemighwe kune chihungo, nyambika ipfijo. Wang'ombe wangu iwanenehe wachinjighwa, na chila chinu chaghoya. Mtse kuchihungo.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu awo ng'awalangitse bae, woka, yumwe kune mghunda wake na yungi kune sang'ano tsake. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nawo iwanu iwakalile wawaghogha iwatumwa wake, wawatendela pfihile na wawakoma. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Imndewa ayo tsakona maya. Apfo kawatuma asikali wake wawakome awala iwawakomile iwatumwa wake, na wailakatsa isi yawo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya kawakema iwatumwa wake kawalongela, chihungo cha ukukwela ma cha tiyali, lekeni awala iwakemighwe watse kune ichihungo ng'awatsile bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apfo, mghende kunzila, ako wowose wamuwona muwakeme watse kune ichihungo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwatumwa wala woka, waghenda mne tsinzila wawaghala wanu wose yawawonile, iwehile na iwanoghile, na chihungo tsachimema iwahenza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Imndewa hayengile mng'anda kuwalolesa iwahenza wake, kamwona imunu yumwe, ng'apfalile bae lighwanda lye ichihungo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamghutsa, ‘Sale yangu, angu wingiletse hano naghwe kwahela lighwanda lye ichihungo?’ Lekeni imunu ayo ng'alongile chinu bae. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya imndewa kawalongela iwatumwa, ‘Mmwowe ghamoko na ghamaghulu mmwase kunze kune chisi. Ako kutsakuwa ne ichililo ne ukughegheda ghamatsino.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Kwaapfila iwakemighwe wengi, lekeni iwasaghulighwe wadodo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:13-17; Luka 20:20-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo Mafarisayo woka na wabama inzila ye ukumtegha Yesu kwa mbuli tsake. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya wawatuma iwanang'ina wawo hamwe ne iwanu wangi wa kingili lya Herodi. Walonga, “Mlangulitsi, twomanya ghendo ghweghwe kolongesa. Naghwe koilangulitsa pfinoghile inzila ye Imulungu, ng'upfuka bae ukulu we imunu wowose, kwaapfila ng'ulola bae ipfihanga pfe iwanu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Utulongele lelo, ukonatse? Apfi pfinogha kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari, au ng'apfinoghile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu tsakamanya ukwiha kwawo, apfo kawalongela, “Mwawang'enye, ule mwobama kunitegha? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nanguseni sendi yamlihila kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamghalila isendi, <verse number="20" style="v"/>Naye kawaghutsa, “Angu chihanga na taghwa lino pfa nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Pfa Kaisari mndewa wa Roma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Lelo, mwing'eni Kaisari aghala gha Kaisari na mwing'eni Imulungu aghala ghe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hawahulike apfo, wakangawala, apfo wamleka, woka tsawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukukwela ne ukutsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:18-27; Luka 20:27-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Litsuwa lilyo, Masadukayo wamwenga, iwanu iwolonga kuduhu kutsilihuka, wamghendela Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wamghutsa walonga, “Mlangulitsi, Musa katulongela immale ang'afa bila kweleka iwana, ndughu yake kobamighwa amkwele chitsuka ayo, ili amwelekele indughu yake iwana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lelo, hakaye hetu hano tsahana iwandughu saba. Wamwanduso kakwela, kuya kafa, na kwaapfila tsakahela iwana, mwehe wake kamlekela ndughu yake. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chinu chichila chimlawila ndughu yake wa keli, wa kadatu, mbaka ndughu yake wa saba. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya mwehe ayo naye kafa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lelo iwanu hawotsotsilihuka mne litsuwa lya kutsilihuka, mwehe ayo katsokuwa wa yuhi mna iwandughu wano saba? Kwaapfila wose tsawamkwela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwakwagha, kwaapfila ng'amanyile bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka au ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu hawatsotsilihuka, kuduhu ukukwela wala ukukwelighwa, watsokuwa ka malaika iwali kulanga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni, imbuli yo ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu, ng'amsomile bae achila chayamlongeleni Imulungu? Kawalongela, <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Nene na Imulungu wa Abrahamu, na Imulungu wa Isaka, na Imulungu wa Yakobu.’ Yeye si Imulungu wa iwanu iwafile bae, ila Imulungu we iwanu waghima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iwanu hawahulike apfi, wakangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:28-34; Luka 10:25-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mafarisayo hawahulike ka Yesu kawatenda Masadukayo wenyamale, wetingana hamwe, <verse number="35" style="v"/>yumwe wawo, imlangulitsi we Ghamalaghitso, kamghutsa Yesu kwa kumtegha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, ihi indaghitso ng'ulu kubita tsose mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “ ‘Mnoghele Imtwatsa Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghose, kwa muhe wako wose, na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Aino iyo indaghitso ng'ulu na ya mwanduso. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na ya keli ighala na ino, umnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ghamalaghitso ghose gha Musa na ghamalangulitso ghe manabii ghohuwila Ghamalaghitso ghano meli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristu ka Imwana wa nani?</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:35-37; Luka 20:41-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mafarisayo hawetingane hamwe, Yesu kawaghutsa, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mwemwe mmwonatse Kiristu. Angu imwana wa nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Imwana wa Daudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Ule lelo Daudi kwa kulongotsighwa na ghumuhe kamkema ‘Imtwatsa?’ Kwaapfila tsakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>‘Imtwatsa kamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">ukale hano hane ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka niweke iwokuhila hasi he ghamaghulu ghako.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ka Daudi komkema, ‘Imtwatsa,’ lelo ikuwatse awe imwanaghe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu yamwidike, na kulawa litsuwa alyo na kughendela kuduhu imunu yadahile kumghutsa Yesu imbuli yoyose.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mtsoghaya</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:38-39; Luka 11:43,46; 20:45-46)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanu na iwanang'ina wake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo wana ukulu wa kulangulitsa Malaghitso gha Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfo mghakinde na mtende aghala ghose ghawowalongela, lekeni mleke kutenda aghala ghawotenda wawo, kwaapfila ng'awotenda bae aghala ghawolonga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wakowa imitsigho mitito na kuwatwika iwanu mmahegha mwawo. Lekeni wawo iwenyegho ng'awobama bae hata kugholosa chidole na kuinula. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ghose ghawotenda, wotenda ili iwanu wawone, kwaapfila wopfala ipfinu ipfandikighwe Ghamalaghitso mne pfihanga pfawo na mne ghamoko ghawo, na wakongetsa utali we ghamaghwanda ghawo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wonoghela kukala hanu hanoghile mne chihungo na kukala mne pfighoda ipfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wonoghela kulamsighwa mmasoko na kukemighwa ne iwanu, ‘Mlangulitsi.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mleke kukemighwa ‘Mlangulitsi,’ kwaapfila mna Mlangulitsi yumwe yaliyeka, na mwemwe mwose mwawandughu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wala mleke kumkema imunu ‘aba’ hano muisi, kwaapfila mna ‘Aba’ yumwe yaliyeka, naye ka kulanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na mleke kukemighwa ‘Ipfilongotsi’ kwaapfila mna ichilongotsi yumwe yaliyeka, naye Kiristu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na imkulu mghati mwenu kobamighwa yawe mtumwa wenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na imunu wowose yetenda mkulu, katsotendighwa mdodo, na wowose yetenda mdodo, katsotendighwa mkulu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koulighita ung'enye wawo</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 12:4; Luka 11:39-42,44,52; 20:47)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye! Kwaapfila mowahindila iwanu libani lya undewa wa kulanga, na mwemwe iwenyegho ng'amkwingila bae, wala ng'amuwalekelela awala iwobama kwingila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye! Mwemwe mwakuja mne tsing'anda tse pfitsuka na kwa ung'enye hamlomba mwolonga mbuli nyingi! Apfo mtsohighighwa ng'ani!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya, yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye mwemwe! Mwoloka ibahali na mwakwanga mne isi yose kumtenda imunu yumwe iyaiwinze dini yenu, na ang'aghaluka, mwomtenda yawe na uwetso mala mbili wa ukwingila Jehanamu kubita mwemwe wenyegho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya mwemwe pfilongotsi pfifita. Mwolonga, ‘Imunu ang'elaha kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu si chinu bae, ila ang'elaha kwe inzahabu ye ing'anda ye Imulungu keyowa.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwawabotsi na pfifita! Chihi ichinoghile, inzahabu au ing'anda ye Imulungu iitenda inzahabu ideghete? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pfipfila mwolonga, imunu ang'elaha kwa hanu hakutambikila si chinu bae, ila ang'elaha kwa nambiko iili hanu ha kutambikila, ayo keyowa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwapfifita mwemwe! Chini chikulu nambiko au hanu ha kutambikila hakutenda nambiko ideghete? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo ayula yelaha kwa hanu ha kutambikila, kelaha kwa chila chinu ichili mchanya mwake, <verse number="21" style="v"/>na ayula yelaha kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, kelaha kwe ing'anda ayo, na kwa Imulungu iyokala mghati mwake. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na ayula yelaha kwa kulanga kelaha kwa chighoda che undewa che Imulungu na kwa Imulungu iyochikalila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya mwemwe imlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, na Mafarisayo! Wang'enye! Kwaapfila mwolapfa tsaka ya pfinu pfidodo ka imitsani iinung'ila ghoya, binzali na kalafuu, lekeni mwoleka kutsikinda mbuli ng'ulu tsa Ghamalaghitso ka pfila haki, libatsi ne ukutoghola. Mghatende agha, na mleke kughaleka aghala ghangi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pfilongotsi pfifita! Mwolapfa ng'onzi mne ghamatsi, lekeni mwometsa ingamiya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye, mwohopfugha chikombe na chiha kwa kunze, lekeni mwoleka mghati mmema ipfinu pfampatile kwa kuboka na ubwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ghwe Mfarisayo chipfita! Tanu wopfughe mghati mwe ichikombe ne ichiha, kuya kunze kutsodegheta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo, mwawang'enye, mwighala ne tsikabuli itsibakigwe ichokaa, kunze tsakwoneka tsinogha, lekeni mghati tsimema imipate ye iwanu iwafile na chila chinu chihile. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Namwe pfipfila, kunze mwakoneka kwe iwanu ka mnogha lekeni mghati mwenu, mmema ung'enye na ghehile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga Mafarisayo watsohighighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 11:47-51)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, na Mafarisayo, mwawang'enye! Mowatsengela tsikabuli manabii na kutsighela unzolingo tsikabuli tse iwanu iwanoghile. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Namwe mwolonga, ‘Tung'akalile mne ghamatsuwa gha iwabala wetu, tung'alekile kwilunga nawo kuwakoma manabii!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo mwelangusa iwenyegho ka mwa watsukulu wa awala yawawakomile manabii, <verse number="32" style="v"/>lelo mghendeletse achila chawatendile iwabala wenu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Mwemwe iwanzoka na iwana we iwanzoka! Mtsohepatse ukuhighighwa Jehanamu? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Apfo nowaghalilani manabii, ne iwanu wane nzewele, na iwalangulitsi. Wangi wawo mtsowakoma na wangi mtsowawamba mna misalaba, wangi mtsowatowa pfiboko mne tsing'anda tsenu tse ukulombela na kuwawinga kulawa ghumji ghuno kughenda ghumji ghungi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Na idamu ye iwanu iwanoghile ikwitike muisi itsodaighwa kuna mwemwe, kulawa idamu ya Abeli ayula yanoghile, mbaka idamu ya Sakariya imwana wa Balakiya yamumkomile haghati he ing'anda ye Imulungu na hanu he ukulapfila inambiko. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, mweleko ghuno ghutsohighighwa kwaajili ya agho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowanoghela iwanu wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 13:34-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Ghwe Yerusalemu, Yerusalemu! Ghweghwe yuwakomile manabii na kuwatowa ghamabwe awala iwatumighwe kuna ghweghwe, mala nyingi tsambama kuweka hamwe iwana wako, ka ing'uku pfowafunamila pfitsiya wake kwa ghamabawa ghake, lekeni ghweghwe, ng'aubamile bae. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mlole, ing'anda yenu ye Imulungu ilekighwa uchuwa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nowalongelani, ng'amtsombona keli bae mbaka mlonge, ‘Kabalikighwa ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kuhinyika kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:1-2; Luka 21:5-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na hayang'ali yakuka, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlanguse matsengo ghe ing'anda ye Imulungu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Angu mwoghona agha ghose? Nowalongelani ghendo, kuduhu libwe ilitsolekighwa mchanya mwa liyaghe, chila libwe litsokwasighwa hasi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kughanzika</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:3-13; Luka 21:7-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali kakala mne Chidunda cha Mitseituni, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela waliyeka wamghutsa, “Utulongele, agha ghose ghatsolawila tsuwachi? Na chihi chitsakuwa chitango cha ukutsa kwako na ukumala kwe iisi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwalangitse, imunu yaleke kuwaghutsukila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu na ukulonga wawo iwo Kiristu Imkombotsi, na watsowaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mtsohulika tsing'ondo na mbuli tsake, lekeni mleke kupfuka. Agho ghose ghobamighwa ghalawile, lekeni ukumala kwe iisi ng'ana kupfike bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Isi ingi itsetowa na isi ingi, undewa ungi witsetowa na undewa ungi. Kutsolawila inzala ng'ulu na mdedemo we isi chila hanu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Agha ghose ka mwanduso wa usungu wa ukweleka imwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Kuya mtsoghoghighwa na kudunuzighwa na kukomighwa. Na isi tsose tsitsowahila kwaajili ya nene. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa agho iwanu wengi watsoleka ukutoghola kwawo, na watsehunduka na wetsehila, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na manabii wengi wa ughutsu watsolawila na kuwaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaajili ye ukongetseka ghehile, unoghelo we iwanu utsohunguka, <verse number="13" style="v"/>lekeni ayula iyodudumila mbaka utsighilo katsokombolighwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na Imbuli ino Inoghile ya undewa itsopetighwa mne isi yose ka ukalangama kwe isi tsose, kuya ukumala kwe iisi kutsakutsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghayo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:14-23; Luka 21:20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mtsakona, ‘lideso lya ukuhinya’ lyalongile nabii Danyeli, litsakwima hanu haenzeluke, ayula iyosoma amanye. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu iwali mne isi ya Yudeya watsumile mpfidunda. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na iyali mchiswili mwe ing'anda yake, aleke kuhulumka kusola chinu chochose. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yali kumghunda aleke kuya kusola lighwanda lyake. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Watsoghaya iwapinga wane tsiinda na awala iwakong'etsa mne ghamatsuwa agho. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mlombe ili kutsuma kwenu kuleke kuwa mne msimu wa chipfeghetsi au mne litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kutsolawila maghayo ng'ana ghalawile bae kulawa isi hailumbighwe mbaka leloli, na ng'aghatsolawila keli bae. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ka ghamatsuwa agho ng'aghahungusighwe bae kuduhu imunu yang'akomboke. Lekeni kwaajili ye iwanu wala iwasaghulighwe, ghamatsuwa agho ghatsohungutsighwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imunu ang'awalongela, ‘Ulole, Kiristu Imkombotsi kahano!’ au ‘Kahala!’ mleke kutoghola. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsina Kiristu wa ughutsu na manabii wa ughutsu watsolawila na kutenda pfitango pfingi na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ili kuwaghutsukila iwanu, ka yodahika hata awala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Muhulikitse! Nongola kuwalongelani imbuli ino ng'ana chipindi chipfike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Apfo, Imunu wowose ang'akulongela, ‘Ulole, kakunyika!’ mleke kughenda, au ‘Kahano, mne chiheleto cha mghati,’ mleke kutoghola. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa ka lumwesa pfalumwemwesa mlanga mwose, kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua mbaka ubali wa kwalikuswela litsua. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hohose hane mtsogha, pfimanga watsetingana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwe Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:24-27; Luka 21:25-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Bahala ghamatsuwa agho gha ghamaghayo aghatsomala, litsua litsoghumighwa ichisi, na lwetsi ng'alutsolapfa bae ghumwanga, tsinondo tsisolaghala kulawa mlanga na tsingupfu itsili kulanga tsitsohighisighwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chipindi acho, chitango che Imwana we Imunu chitsolawila mlanga na isi tsose tsitsolila, iwanu watsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mna ghamawingu mlanga, hamwe ne ingupfu na utunitso mkulu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Naye katsowatuma wamalaika wake wane malati ilikemela sideke, nawo watsoweka hamwe awala iwasaghulighwe kulawa chila ubali we iisi, kulawa utsighilo uno we lilanga mbaka utsighilo ungi.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:28-31; Luka 21:29-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mwilangulitse imbuli ino kulawa mne mbiki ghwa mkuyu, ghamaputila ghake haghakuwa madeke na kwandusa kutsuka, mwomanya mvula tsahabehi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pfipfila, hamkona agha ghose mmanye chipindi cha habehi ghendo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka agha ghose ghalawile, <verse number="35" style="v"/>lilanga ne isi pfitsoluta lekeni mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta mbe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu imunu iyomanya litsuwa wala isaa.</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 13:32-37; Luka 17:26-30,34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Kuduhu imunu iyomanya litsuwa wala isaa ayo, hata wamalaika wa kulanga, wala Imwana, ila Aba yaliyeka iyomanya. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ka pfailawile mne ghamatsuwa gha Nuhu, itsakuwa pfipfo hayatsakutsa Imwana we Imunu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa agho ng'ana ghamafuliko ghalawile, iwanu tsawang'ali wakuja na ukunwa, wokwela na kukwelighwa mbaka litsuwa lya Nuhu hengile mne safina. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ng'awamanyile bae choni ching'alawile mbaka ghamafuliko ghatsa na kuwasola wose. Apfi pfipfo pfaitsolawila hayatsakutsa Imwana we Imunu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iwanu weli watsakuwa kumghunda, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwapinga weli watsotwanga hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Apfo, mwalangitse, kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae litsuwa lyachi Imtwatsa wenu hayatsakutsa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lekeni mmanye apfi, ka mwenye kaye ang'amanyile imbapfi kakutsa tsuwachi, ang'akalile meso, na tsang'oileka bae ing'anda yake ibenighwe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe mwiyandae, kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa mne isaa ng'amuilolele bae yatse.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mtumwa yotogholighwa na yang'otogholighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 12:41-48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Kuya yuhi imtumwa yotogholighwa na yane ihekima? Ayula imtwatsa wake yamwikile yawemile iwatumwa wangi mne ing'anda yake na kuweng'a ichijo chawo chipindi chinoghile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kabweda imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake hayatsakuya na kumpfika kotenda apfo, <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, imtwatsa ayo katsomwika kwimilitsa ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lekeni ka mtumwa keha, na ang'elongela imwenyegho, ‘Imtwatsa wangu katsokawa kuya,’ <verse number="49" style="v"/>kuya kakwandusa ukuwatowa iwatumwa weyaghe na ukuja na ukunwa hamwe ne iwanu iwopatika. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Imtwatsa we imtumwa ayo katsakutsa mne litsuwa lyang'omlolela bae na mne isaa yang'aimanyile bae. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Imtwatsa ayo katsomghana pfihindi pfihindi na katsomwika hamwe ne iwang'enye, ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye wali kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Chipindi acho undewa wa kulanga witseghala ne wali kumi, iwasolile pfitasa pfawo na waghenda kumbokela imunu yokwela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Watano mna wawo tsawabotsi, na watano wangi tsawana ihekima. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Awala wali wabotsi wosola pfitasa pfawo, lekeni ng'awasolile bae ghamafuta ghoghose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Awala wane ihekima, wasola tsisupa itsimemile ghamafuta hamwe na pfitasa pfawo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imunu yokwela tsakakawa kutsa, apfo wali wose wapata nongo, wawasa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Chilo chikulu, kulawila litsi, ‘Imunu yokwela kapfika! Mlawe mkambokele!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya wali wose walamka, watuwa pfitasa pfawo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Awala iwabotsi wawalongela awala wane ihekima, ‘Mtugholele ghamafuta ghenu chidogho kwaapfila pfitasa pfetu pfotsimika.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni awala wane ihekima wawedika, ‘Mbe, ng'aghotwenela bae twetwe na mwemwe, ghendani kwe iwanu iwohutsa ghamafuta mkaghule.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni hawang'ali woghenda kughula ghamafuta, imunu yokwela tsakapfika. Wali awala iweyandaye, wengila naye mng'anda mne chihungo cha ukukwela. Na libani lihindighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hambele chidogho wali wabotsi woya, walonga, ‘Imtwatsa! Imtwatsa! Utupfughulile libani!’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni kawedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, siwamanyile bae.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Apfo mkale meso, kwaapfila ng'ammanyile bae litsuwa au isaa.</para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye watumwa wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(Luka 19:11-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Pfipfila undewa wa kulanga witseghala ne imunu iyoghenda ghumwanza, iyawakemile iwatumwa wake na kuweka wemilitse tsimali tsake. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kamwing'a chila yumwe kwa kulola uwetso wake, yumwe kamwing'a mikoba mitano, yungi mikoba mili, na yungi mkoba ghumwe. Kuya koka ghumwanza. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bahala imtumwa iyabokele mikoba mitano kaghenda kutsitendela sang'ano, kapata mikoba mingi mitano. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pfipfila, ayula iyabokele talanta mbili tsongetseka keli talanta mbili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni ayula iyabokele talanta imwe, koka kahimba hasi, kaipfisa isendi ye imtwatsa wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Ghamatsuwa pfaghalutile, imtwatsa we iwatumwa awo koya na kwandusa kupeta tsisendi hamwe nawo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imtumwa iyabokele talanta tano kamghalila talanta tano tsingi, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa, tsakungaya talanta tano, ulole tsongetseka talanta tsingi tano.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Imtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Kutenda ghoya, mtumwa yunoghile na mtogholighwa! Tsakutogholighwa kwa ipfinu pfidodo, nitsokwika wimilitse pfinu pfingi. Utse udeng'elele na mtwatsa wako!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Kuya imtumwa iyeng'ighwe talanta mbili naye katsa, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa tsakungaya talanta mbili, ulole, tsongetseka tsingi mbili.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Imtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Kutenda ghoya, imtumwa yunoghile na yutogholighwa! Tsakutogholighwa kwa pfinu pfidodo, nitsokwika wimilitse pfinu pfingi, utse na udeng'elele hamwe na mtwatsa wako!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kuya imtumwa iyabokele mkoba umwe katsa, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa, nokumanya ghweghwe kwa imunu mkomu, kopfuna hanu ng'auhandile bae, na kokunga hanu ng'aupwililise bae tsimbeghu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo tsanipfuka, mbuka kupfisa isendi yako mne lidongo. Ulole, aino iyo isendi yako.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Ghweghwe kwa imtumwa wihile na imdebwe! Tsakumanya ka nene nopfuna hanu sihandile na kukunga hanu sipwililise bae tsimbeghu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apfo tsakubamighwa kuika bengi isendi yangu, ili hambuile na nene nyambulile ifaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“ ‘Mumboke sendi ayo mmwing'e ayu yane mikoba kumi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwaapfila wowose iyalinacho, katsokongetsighwa, na wowose iyalihela chinu hata achila chayalinacho katsobokighwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na mmwase imtumwa yuno yehile kunze mne ichisi, ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwang'olo na iwamene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Imwana we Imunu hayatsakutsa mne utunitso wake, hamwe na wamalaika, katsokala mne chighoda chake che undewa mne utunitso wa kulanga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iwanu wa kolo tsose watsetingana hambele hake, naye katsowabaghula ka iwadimi pfawowabaghula iwang'olo na iwamene. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Katsoweka iwanu iwanoghile kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na iwanu wehile ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuya Imndewa katsowalongela awala iwakalile ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo, ‘Mtse, mwemwe imbalikighwe na Aba wangu, mhale undewa wamwikilighwe mwemwe kulawa iisi hailumbighwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsanikala ne inzala, namwe mngaya ichijo, tsanikala ne ing'ilu, namwe mngaya ghamatsi, tsanamhenza namwe mnibokela. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tsanahela lighwanda namwe mnipfetsa, tsanamtamu namwe mutsa kundola, tsanamchifungo, namwe mnyangila.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Baho iwanu iwanoghile watsomwidika, ‘Imtwatsa wetu tsuwachi hatukwonile kuna inzala na tukwing'a ichijo, au kuna ing'ilu na twetwe tukwing'a ghamatsi? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuya tsuwachi hatukwonile kwa mhenza na twetwe tukubokela, au kwahela lighwanda na twetwe tukupfetsa? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tsuwachi hatukwonile kwa mtamu au kwa mchifungo na twetwe tukwangila?’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Imndewa katsowedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, chochose chamumtendele yumwe wa wano wandughu tsangu, mnendela nene.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Kuya katsowalongela awala iwali kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso, ‘Lawani hana nene, yamlighitighwe, mghende kune ghumoto ghwa ghamatsuwa ghose, ighwikighwe kwaajili ya Yehile ne malaika wake! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsanikala ne inzala ng'amngaile bae ichijo, tsanina ing'ilu ng'amngaile bae ghamatsi, <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tsanamhenza, ng'amnibokele bae, tsanahela lighwanda, ng'amnipfetse bae. Tsanamtamu na tsanamchifungo, ng'amtsile bae kumbona.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Kuya nawo watsamwidika, ‘Imtwatsa, tsuwachi hatukwonile kuna inzala au kuna ing'ilu, au kwamhenza au kwahela lighwanda au kwamtamu au kwa mne chifungo, na twetwe ng'atukwapfile bae?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Imndewa naye katsowedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, ka tsamlema kumwapfila yumwe we iwadodo wano, tsamlema kunyapfila nene.’ <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuya watsoghenda kune ukughaya kwa ghamatsuwa ghose, lekeni iwanu iwanoghile watsoghenda kune ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Inzila ye ukumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:1-2; Luka 22:1-2; Yohane 11:45-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga mbuli atso, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ka pfammanya ghatsuwa meli hambele itsakuwa Pasaka, na Imwana we Imunu katsoghoghighwa ili awambighwe mna msalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu watingana mne ing'anda ye imlapfa inambiko mkulu, taghwa lyake Kayafa, <verse number="4" style="v"/>tsawabama inzila ya kumghogha Yesu chinyelenyele wamkome. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Walonga, “Lekeni ileke kutendeka mne chihungo, hela kutsolawila hengele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakighwa ghamafuta ako Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:3-9; Yohane 12:1-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali Betaniya mne ing'anda ya Simoni mkoma, <verse number="7" style="v"/>pinga yumwe kamghendela ne isupa ya alabasta iimemile ghamafuta ighonung'ila gha bei ng'ulu, kamghela mwitwi hayang'ali yakuja mmetsa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina hawonile apfo wona maya, waghutsa, “Angu choni kwaghitsa ghamafuta pfino?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ghamafuta ghano ghang'autsighwe kwa bei ng'ulu, tsisendi weng'ighwe iwahingwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya chawang'ali wolonga, kawalongela, “Ule mwomdesa ipinga ayu? Kanendela chinu chinoghile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iwahingwa mtsokala nawo ghamatsuwa ghose, lekeni ng'amtsokala bae na nene ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hayanighele ghamafuta ighonung'ila mlukuli mwangu, katenda apfo kuniyandaa kwa ukutsikighwa kwangu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, kokose imbuli inoghile haitsopetighwa mne iisi yose, chayatendile ipinga yuno chitsopetighwa kwa kumkumbuka yeye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumuhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:10-11; Luka 22:3-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Yuda Isikarioti yumwe we awala iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kawaghendela iwatambika wakulu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kawaghutsa, “Ning'awapfila ukumhunduka Yesu, mtsongaya choni?” Wampetela tsisendi selasini, wamwing'a. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kulawa baho, Yuda yang'ali yobama inzila ya kumuhunduka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuja ichijo che Paska ne iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:12-21; Luka 22:7-13,21-23; Yohane 13:21-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lye mwanduso lye Chihungo che Ipfighate ipfihela hamila, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Kobama tukutandile kwani ichijo che Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Mghende mne ghumji kwa imunu yumwe mumlongele, ‘Imlangulitsi kolonga chipindi changu chahabehi. Nene na iwanang'ina wangu tutsakuja Pasaka mng'anda mwako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfo iwanang'ina watenda ka Yesu pfayawalongele, na waitanda Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nemihe haipfikile, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli wakala mmetsa wakuja. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wakuja, kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, yumwe wenu katsonihunduka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina tsawona usungu, chila yumwe kandusa kumlongela Yesu, “Apfi nene Imtwatsa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Imunu iyopfabika chighate chake hamwe na nene mne ibakuli, katsonihunduka. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imwana we imunu katsokufa ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga. Lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula iyomhunduka Imwana we Imunu. Ing'awile ng'apfu kwe imunu ka ayo ka ng'elekighwe bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yuda, ayula iyabamile kumhunduka Yesu, kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, si nene bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo cha nemihe che Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:22-26; Luka 22:14-20; 1 Wakolinto 11:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wakuja, Yesu kasola ichighate, kachibaliki, kachibena kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, kalonga, “Msole mje, aluno lukuli Iwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya kasola chikombe, kachibaliki, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, kalonga, “Wose mnwele chikombe achi.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Aino iyo idamu yangu ye lilaghano, iikwitike kwaajili ya wengi kuleghusighwa nzambi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nowalongelani, sitsakunwa keli bae idipfai mbaka litsuwa lila hanitsoinwa idipfai ya sambi na mwemwe mne undewa wa Aba wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hawamalitse kwimba wila, woka, waghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga Petiri katsombela</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:27-31; Luka 22:31-34; Yohane 13:36-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Chilo chino mtsotsuma na kundeka, ka pfayandikighwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Nitsomtowa imdimi,</para>
  <para style="q">na iwang'olo we likingili watsopwililika,</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni hanitsotsilihuka, nitsowalongolani Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petiri kamwidika, “Hata wose wang'akuleka, nene sikuleka bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongelela Petiri, “Nokulongela ghendo, chilo chino ng'ana ijogholo yeke, kutsombela mala ndatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Petiri kamwidika, “Sikubela bae, hata ka nobamighwa nife naghwe.” Na iwanang'ina wose walonga pfipfo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:32-42; Luka 22:39-46)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kaghenda ne iwanang'ina wake hanu hakemighwe Getisemane, kawalongela, “Mkale hano, nene noghenda hala kulomba.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kamsola Petiri na iwana weli wa Sebedayo, kuya kandusa kwona usungu, na kughanzika. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Ghumoyo ghwangu ghuna usungu mwingi, mbaka nobama nife. Mkale hano na mkale meso na nene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kaghenda hambele chidogho, katowa maghoti, kenama mbaka chihanga chake chighusa hasi, kalomba, “Aba wangu, ka yodahika, uchileghuse chikombe chino che maghayo kuna nene. Lekeni si ka nene pfanibama, ila ka pfaubama ghweghwe.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya kawoyila iwanang'ina wake, kawapfika wawasa. Kamghutsa Petiri, “Angu ng'amdahile bae kukala meso na nene hata kwa isaa imwe?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Mkale meso, mlombe ili mleke kwingila mne maghetso, ghumoyo ghwobama, lekeni lukuli lwahela ingupfu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kaghenda lwakeli, kalomba, “Aba wangu, ka ng'aidahika bae kuchileghusa ichikombe chino che maghayo mbaka nichinwe, ghoubama ghweghwe ghatendeke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hayohile lwa keli, kawapfika keli wawasa kwaapfila nenge tsawo ng'atsidahile bae kukala meso. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kawaleka koka keli, na kalomba lwa kadatu, kalonga chinu chichila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuya kawoyila iwanang'ina wake kawalongela, “Angu mng'ali mwowasa na kubwihila? Mlole, isaa ya habehi, na Imwana we Imunu kakwing'ighwa kwe iwanu wane nzambi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mwinuke, tukeni! Hayo kakutsa iyonihunduka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:43-50; Luka 22:47-53; Yohane 18:3-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hayang'ali yolonga apfo, Yuda yumwe we iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kapfika ne iwanu wengi iwakindile imimaghe ne ipfilungu, tsawatumighwa na iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu we iwanu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yuda tsakaweng'a chitango. “Imunu yanimnonela iyo yuyo yamumbama, mghogheni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bahala Yuda kamghendela Yesu, kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, nokulamsa!” Kuya kamnonela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Sale yangu, utende achila chautsile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya iwanu awo wamghendela Yesu, wamkinda, wamghogha. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yumwe we awala iwakalile na Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kasomola limaghe lyake, kamtowa imtumwa we imtambika mkulu, kamghana lighutwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Uyitse limaghe hanu hake, kwaapfila awala wose iwokinda limaghe watsakufa kwa limaghe. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka ning'adahile kumlomba Aba wangu, naye ang'anighalile makingili ghe asikali kubita kumi na meli ghe wamalaika watse kunyapfila. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lekeni lelo ghatsotimilatse Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka igholonga, yobamighwa ilawile pfino?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu kawalongela iwanu wala, “Angu mutsa na mimaghe na pfilungu kungogha, ka nene na mbapfi? Chila litsuwa tsanikala namwe na nilangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, ng'amnighoghile bae. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lekeni agha ghose ghalawila ili ghawandikile manabii ghatimile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya iwanang'ina wake wamleka, watsuma.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hambele he libalatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:53-65; Luka 22:54-55; Yohane 18:13-14,19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Awala iwamghoghile Yesu wamghala kwa Kayafa, imtambika mkulu, kwawatinganile iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso ne iwakulu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Lekeni, Petiri kamuwinza kwa kutali mbaka hachitala he mtambika mkulu. Kengila mghati, kakala hasi na iwabetetsi, yalole choni chitsolawila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Iwabala we inambiko na Libalatsa lyose wang'ali wobama ukalangama we ughutsu kwaajili ya Yesu, ili wadahe kumkoma. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awapatile ukalangama wowose bae, hata ka iwakalangama wengi we ughutsu watsa hambele.</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya iwanu weli watsa hambele, <verse number="61" style="v"/>walonga, “Imunu yuno kalonga apfi, ‘Nodaha kuimwagha Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga keli mne ghamatsuwa madatu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Kuya mtambika mkulu kenuka kamlongela Yesu, “Kwahela che ukwidika? Agha ighawolonga iwanu wano gholongesa?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kanyamala. Mtambika mkulu, kamlongela, “Wilahe kwe Imulungu iyali mghima. Utulongele ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwolonga. Lekeni nowalongelani wose, kulawa sambi na kughendelela mtsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakala ubali wa kujilo we Imulungu Yane ingupfu, kakutsa mne ghamawingu gha kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Bahala Mtambika mkulu kadegha ghamaghwanda ghake kalonga, “Kaligha! Ule lelo twobama keli wakalangama? Mwemwe wenyegho mmuhulika pfayalighile. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Mwemwe mkonatse?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Katotsa, yakomighwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Wambwalulila ghamate mchihanga na wamtowa. Wamwenga wamtowa makofi. <verse number="68" style="v"/>Walonga, “Ghwe Kiristu, utange yuhi yakutowile?”</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 14:66-72; Luka 22:56-62; Yohane 18:15-18,25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Petiri tsakakala kunze mwe chikuta, na imtumwa yumwe pinga kamghendela, kamlongela, “Naghwe pfipfila tsakwahamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Lekeni Petiri kabela hambele ha wose, kalonga, “Simanyile bae chaulonga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Kuya kalawa kunze, ako imtumwa yungi pinga kamwona, kuya kawalongela iwanu, “Hayuno naye tsakahamwe na Yesu wa Natsareti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Petiri kabela keli, kwa kwilaha, “Simmanyile bae imunu ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Hambele chidogho, awala iwemile hala wamghendela Petiri walonga, “Naghwe kwa yumwe wawo ghendo, kwaapfila hata kulonga kwako kolangusa ghweghwe kwa Mgalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Kuya Petiri kandusa kwilighita na kwilaha, kalonga, “Mbe, simmanyile bae imunu ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">Bahala ijogholo keka, <verse number="75" style="v"/>na Petiri kakumbuka imbuli iyailongile Yesu. “Ijogholo ng'ana yeke, kutsombela mala ndatu.” Kalawa kunze, kalila kwa usungu.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:1; Luka 23:1-2; Yohane 18:28-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo, iwatambika wakulu ne iwakulu we iwanu wose tsawalamla kumkoma Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wamwoha, wamlongotsa wamghala kwa Pilato, mkulu wa isi iyasaghulighwe ne mkulu Roma.</para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Ghamatendo 1:18-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda, iyamhunduke Yesu, hayonile Yesu kahighighwa, kona usungu katsuyitsa sendi tsila selasini tsayasolile kwe iwatambika wakulu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Nitotsa, kwaapfila nimhunduka imunu iyalihela totso yakomighwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni wawo wamwidika, “Twetwe ng'atukwalangula bae, alyo lyako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo Yuda kasa sendi atso mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kuya kaghenda kwikoma kwa kwibota imwenyegho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iwatambika wakulu wadondola sendi tsila, walonga, “Ng'apfinoghile bae kwika sendi tsino mne hatsina ye Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kwaapfila atsino sendi tsa idamu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo walamla sendi atso waghulile mghunda wa wafina pfiha uwe hanu he kutsikila iwahenza. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ndo mana mbaka leloli mghunda awo wokemighwa, “Mghunda wa Damu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya achila chayalongile nabii Yeremiya chitimila, “Watsosola sendi selasini, tsawatoghole iwanu wa Isiraeli kumlihila, <verse number="10" style="v"/>watsitumila kughulila mghunda we wafina pfiha, ka Imtwatsa pfayanilaghitse.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pilato komghutsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:2-5; Luka 23:3-5; Yohane 18:33-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu tsakema hambele ha imkulu wa Roma, na imkulu ayo kamghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe kwa Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kolonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iwabala we inambiko ne iwakulu hawang'ali womwing'a ghamaghomba, ng'edike chochose bae. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya Pilato kamghutsa, “Angu ng'uhulika bae ghamaghomba ghano ghowokulonga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu ng'edike imbuli yoyose bae, mkulu ayo kakangawala ghendo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yakomighwe</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:6-15; Luka 23:13-25; Yohane 18:39-19:16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Chila chihungo che Paska imkulu wa Roma katsowela kumlekelela imwohingwa yumwe, iyawambamile iwanu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tsahana mwohighwa yumwe, iyamanyike ng'ani yakemighwe Baraba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo iwanu hawetingane, Pilato kawaghutsa, “Mwobama nimlekelele yuhi? Baraba au Yesu yokemighwa Kiristu?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Pilato tsakamanya ghendo ka wamghala Yesu kuna yeye, kwaapfila tsawamwonela chepfu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato hayang'ali kakala mne chighoda cha kuhighila, mwehe wake kamtumila usenga, “Uleke kumtendela chochose imunu ayo yalihela totso. Kwaapfila leloli nechilo tsanidununzika ng'ani mndoto kwaajili yake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni iwabala we inambiko na iwakulu, waghusongesa mtingano we iwanu wamlombe Pilato amlekelele Baraba na Yesu yakomighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pilato kawaghutsa keli, “Yuhi mna wano weli mwombama nimlekelele?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Baraba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato kawaghutsa, “Lelo nimtende choni ayu Yesu yokemighwa Kiristu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wose wamwidika, “Umuwambe mna msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pilato kawaghutsa, “Ule? Choni chihile chayatendile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni wose wakemelela hamwe, “Umuwambe mna msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pilato hayonile ng'odaha bae chochose, ne hengele tsalyakwandusa kulawila, kasola ghamatsi, kahopfugha ghamoko ghake hambele he iwanu, kalonga, “Nene nahela litotso kwa ukufa kwe imunu ayu, alyo lyenu iwenyegho!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanu wose walonga, “Totso lye ukufa kwake liwe mchanya mwetu na mchanya mwe iwanetu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kuya kamlekelela Baraba kuna wawo. Lekeni kalonga wampfapule Yesu na mijeledi, kamlapfa yawambighwe mna msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wombetsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:16-20; Yohane 19:2-3)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya asikali wa Pilato wamghala Yesu mne ing'anda ye imndewa, na kingili lyose lye asikali limmemela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wamtsula ghamaghwanda ghake, wampfatsa lighwanda dung'u, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya wabota fiya ya tsimiwa walika mwitwi mwake, kuya weka ing'weku mne ghumoko ghwake wa kujilo, watowa ghamaghoti hambele hake. Wambetsa, walonga, “Mbukwa, Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wambwalulila ghamate, wasola ing'weku wamtowa mwitwi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hawamalitse kumbetsa, wamtsula lighwanda alyo, wampfatsa ghamaghwanda ghake. Wamghala yawambighwe mna msalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambighwa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:21-32; Luka 23:26-43; Yohane 19:17-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hawang'ali wakuka, watingana ne imunu yumwe iyolawila Kirene, iyakemighwe Simoni, wamnanahitsa yaughale msalaba. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wapfika hanu hokemighwa Goligota, mana yake Chibombwe che Litwi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wamwing'a Yesu idipfai iitifighwe ne ichinu che usungu, lekeni hayailanzile, kalema ukunwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wamuwamba mna msalaba, kuya wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa kutowa simbi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wakala hasi wamlolesa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Na hachanya he litwi lyake, wandika lighomba lyake, “Ayuno Yesu, Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iwabapfi weli nawo tsawawambighwa hamwe naye, yumwe ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na yungi ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Iwanu iwalutile hala, wahighitsa ghamatwi ghawo kwa kumbetsa, wamligha, <verse number="40" style="v"/>walonga, “Ambe ghweghwe ung'aimwaghile Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga keli mne ghamatsuwa madatu! Lelo wikombole imwenyeng'o. Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu hulumka mna msalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pfipfila iwatambika wakulu na iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso, na iwabala wose wambesa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walonga, “Kawakombola iwanu wangi, lekeni ng'odaha bae kwikombola imwenyegho, ambe yeye ka Imndewa we Isiraeli, tumlole lelo yahulumke mna msalaba, na twetwe tutsomtoghola. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tsakamuhuwila Imulungu na kalonga ‘Nene na Imwana we Imulungu.’ Lekani lelo tulole Imulungu yamkombole ka kombama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pfipfila iwabapfi weli iwawambighwe hamwe naye, wamligha.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:33-41; Luka 23:44-49; Yohane 19:28-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kulawa saa sita mbaka saa tisa ichisi tsachighubika isi yose. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Haipfikile saa tisa, Yesu kakemelela, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Mana yake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, ebali kondeka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iwanu iwemile hala hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Komkema Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Bahala yumwe wawo katsuma kasola dodoki, kalika mne dipfai iing'ang'a, kuya kalika mne ing'weku kamwing'a Yesu yainwe. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Awala iwanu wangi walonga, “Lelo mleke tulole ka Eliya kakutsa kumkombola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kakemelela keli kwa litsi likulu, kuya kafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Bahala lipatsiya ililimghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka pfihindi pfibili kulawa uchang'a mbaka hasi. Isi tsaidedema na ghamabambalawe ghatulika. <verse number="52" style="v"/>tsikabuli tsighubuka ne iwanu wengi we Imulungu iwafile tsawatsilihuka. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Walawa kunze mwe tsikabuli, na Yesu hayatsilihuke waghenda mne ghumji mwenzeluka, na iwanu wengi wawona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ayula imkulu we asikali na awala iwakalile naye womkalitsa Yesu, hawonile isi ihighisika na ghose ighalawile, tsawapfuka, walonga, “Ayuno tsa Imwana we Imulungu ghendo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Tsakukala na iwapinga wengi, wololesa kwa kutali, awo iwo iwamuwinzile Yesu kulawa Galilaya na iwamwapfile. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mna wawo, tsakukala na Mariya Magidalena, Mariya mai wawo tsina Jakobu na Yosefu na mai we iwana wa Sebedayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutsikighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56; Yohane 19:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nemihe haipfikile, imunu yumwe tajiri kulawa Arimataya iyakemighwe Yosefu kapfika, naye imwenyegho tsakakala mwanang'ina wa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Kamghendela Pilato kamlomba yamwing'e lukuli lwa Yesu, na Pilato kalaghitsa yeng'ighwe. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yosefu kalusola lukuli, kalupfatsa isanda inoghile, <verse number="60" style="v"/>kalwika hanu hake imwenyegho ha sambi ha kutsikila. Kuya kabingilisa libwe kulu hambele he libani lye likabuli, kuya koka. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mariya Magidalena na Mariya yungi tsawakala baho, welolesa ne likabuli.</para>
  <para style="s">Asikali hane likabuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya keli, ilili litsuwa lya Sabato, iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo waghenda kwa Pilato. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Walonga, “Imndewa, twokumbuka mghutsu yula, hayang'ali mghima tsakalonga, ‘Ghang'abita ghamatsuwa madatu, nitsotsilihuka keli.’ <verse number="64" style="v"/>Apfo, ulaghitse kabuli lyake walikalitse ghoya mbaka mne litsuwa lya kadatu. Hela iwanang'ina wake wodaha kutsa na kulwiba lukuli lwake na kuwalongela iwanu kuwa katsilihuka. Ughutsu uno wa utsighilo utsakuwa wiha kubita ula wa mwanduso.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Pilato kawedika, “Mnawo asikali, mghende mkakalitse likabuli ka pfamdaha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Apfo woka na wakalitsa ghoya likabuli kwa kwika chitango mne libwe na wawaleka asikali wokalitsa.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 16:1-10; Luka 24:1-12; Yohane 20:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya Sabato halimalile, lupfilipfili litsuwa lye mwanduso lye lijuma, Mariya Magidalena na Mariya yungi waghenda kulola likabuli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsakulawila mdedemo mkulu we isi, kwaapfila malaika we Imtwatsa tsakahulumka kulawa kulanga, kaghenda mne likabuli kalibingilisa libwe hambali, kalikalila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chihanga chake tsachikala ka lumwesa, na lighwanda lyake tsalitselu chwee! <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanu iwang'ali wokalitsa wapfuka ghendo, wadedema na woneka ka wafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Malaika ayo kawalongela iwapinga, “Mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila nomanya mwombama Yesu iyawambighwe mna msalaba. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka ka pfayalongile. Mtse mlole hanu hayawasile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lelo msumke mghende, muwalongelele pfino iwanang'ina wake. ‘Yesu katsilihuka, naye katsowalongola kughenda Galilaya. Baho mtsomwona.’ Haya lelo, ma niwalongela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo iwapinga awo wasumka kuka kulawa hane likabuli, kwa kupfuka na ndeng'elelo ng'ulu, watsuma waghenda kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bahala Yesu ketingana nawo, kawalongela, “Nowalamsani.” Wamghendela, wakinda ghamaghulu ghake, wamtamanila. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka. Mghende mkawalongele wandughu tsangu waghende Galilaya, ako watsombona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwakalitse likabuli wolonga ichilawile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iwapinga hawang'ali wamnzila, asikali wangi mna awala iwakalitse likabuli waghenda kune ghumji wawalongela watambika wakulu chila chinu ichilawile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iwakulu we inambiko hawetingane ne iwabala wapanga imbuli yawo, waweng'a sendi nyingi awala iwakalitse likabuli, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kuya wawalongela, “Walongeleni pfino iwanu, ‘Iwanang'ina wake watsa nechilo, wamwiba hatuwasile.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na imkulu we isi ang'ahulika mbuli ino, twetwe tutsolonga naye, namwe ng'amtsokwingila mne maghayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo awala asikali wasola sendi, na watenda ka pfawalongelighwe. Na mbuli ayo yenela kwe Wayahudi mbaka leloli.</para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(Maliki 16:14-18; Luka 24:36-49; Yohane 20:19-23; Ghamatendo 1:6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe waghenda Galilaya kune chidunda, ako Yesu kwayawalongele waghende. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hawamwonile, wamtamanila lekeni wangi wapfuka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghendela, kawalongela, “Ukulu wose uli kulanga na uli muisi ning'ighwa nene. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfo, mghende mkawatende iwanu we isi tsose wawe wanang'ina wangu, muwabatitse kwa taghwa lya Aba na Imwana na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, <verse number="20" style="v"/>na muwalangulitse kughakinda aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitse. Na nene na hamwe namwe ghamatsuwa ghose mbaka iisi haitsomala.”</para>
</usx>
